  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">yohanalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <para style="toc2">yohanaH</para>
  <para style="toc3">yohanaH</para>
  <para style="mt1">yohanalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Adau vAda AsIt sa ca vAda IzvareNa sArdhamAsIt sa vAdaH svayamIzvara eva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>sa AdAvIzvareNa sahAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tena sarvvaM vastu sasRje sarvveSu sRSTavastuSu kimapi vastu tenAsRSTaM nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>sa jIvanasyAkAraH, tacca jIvanaM manuSyANAM jyotiH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tajjyotirandhakAre pracakAze kintvandhakArastanna jagrAha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yohan nAmaka eko manuja IzvareNa preSayAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadvArA yathA sarvve vizvasanti tadarthaM sa tajjyotiSi pramANaM dAtuM sAkSisvarUpo bhUtvAgamat,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>sa svayaM tajjyoti rna kintu tajjyotiSi pramANaM dAtumAgamat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>jagatyAgatya yaH sarvvamanujebhyo dIptiM dadAti tadeva satyajyotiH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>sa yajjagadasRjat tanmadya eva sa AsIt kintu jagato lokAstaM nAjAnan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>nijAdhikAraM sa Agacchat kintu prajAstaM nAgRhlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tathApi ye ye tamagRhlan arthAt tasya nAmni vyazvasan tebhya Izvarasya putrA bhavitum adhikAram adadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>teSAM janiH zoNitAnna zArIrikAbhilASAnna mAnavAnAmicchAto na kintvIzvarAdabhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>sa vAdo manuSyarUpeNAvatIryya satyatAnugrahAbhyAM paripUrNaH san sArdham asmAbhi rnyavasat tataH pituradvitIyaputrasya yogyo yo mahimA taM mahimAnaM tasyApazyAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tato yohanapi pracAryya sAkSyamidaM dattavAn yo mama pazcAd AgamiSyati sa matto gurutaraH; yato matpUrvvaM sa vidyamAna AsIt; yadartham ahaM sAkSyamidam adAM sa eSaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>aparaJca tasya pUrNatAyA vayaM sarvve kramazaH kramazonugrahaM prAptAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>mUsAdvArA vyavasthA dattA kintvanugrahaH satyatvaJca yIzukhrISTadvArA samupAtiSThatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>kopi manuja IzvaraM kadApi nApazyat kintu pituH kroDastho'dvitIyaH putrastaM prakAzayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tvaM kaH? iti vAkyaM preSTuM yadA yihUdIyalokA yAjakAn levilokAMzca yirUzAlamo yohanaH samIpe preSayAmAsuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA sa svIkRtavAn nApahnUtavAn nAham abhiSikta ityaGgIkRtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan tarhi ko bhavAn? kiM eliyaH? sovadat na; tataste'pRcchan tarhi bhavAn sa bhaviSyadvAdI? sovadat nAhaM saH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan tarhi bhavAn kaH? vayaM gatvA prerakAn tvayi kiM vakSyAmaH? svasmin kiM vadasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA sovadat| paramezasya panthAnaM pariSkuruta sarvvataH| itIdaM prAntare vAkyaM vadataH kasyacidravaH| kathAmimAM yasmin yizayiyo bhaviSyadvAdI likhitavAn soham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ye preSitAste phirUzilokAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan yadi nAbhiSiktosi eliyosi na sa bhaviSyadvAdyapi nAsi ca, tarhi lokAn majjayasi kutaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yohan pratyavocat, toye'haM majjayAmIti satyaM kintu yaM yUyaM na jAnItha tAdRza eko jano yuSmAkaM madhya upatiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sa matpazcAd Agatopi matpUrvvaM varttamAna AsIt tasya pAdukAbandhanaM mocayitumapi nAhaM yogyosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>yarddananadyAH pArasthabaithabArAyAM yasminsthAne yohanamajjayat tasmina sthAne sarvvametad aghaTata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>pare'hani yohan svanikaTamAgacchantaM yizuM vilokya prAvocat jagataH pApamocakam Izvarasya meSazAvakaM pazyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yo mama pazcAdAgamiSyati sa matto gurutaraH, yato hetormatpUrvvaM so'varttata yasminnahaM kathAmimAM kathitavAn sa evAyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>aparaM nAhamenaM pratyabhijJAtavAn kintu isrAyellokA enaM yathA paricinvanti tadabhiprAyeNAhaM jale majjayitumAgaccham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>punazca yohanaparamekaM pramANaM datvA kathitavAn vihAyasaH kapotavad avatarantamAtmAnam asyoparyyavatiSThantaM ca dRSTavAnaham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>nAhamenaM pratyabhijJAtavAn iti satyaM kintu yo jale majjayituM mAM prairayat sa evemAM kathAmakathayat yasyoparyyAtmAnam avatarantam avatiSThantaJca drakSayasi saeva pavitre Atmani majjayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>avastannirIkSyAyam Izvarasya tanaya iti pramANaM dadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pare'hani yohan dvAbhyAM ziSyAbhyAM sArddheM tiSThan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yizuM gacchantaM vilokya gaditavAn, Izvarasya meSazAvakaM pazyataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>imAM kathAM zrutvA dvau ziSyau yIzoH pazcAd IyatuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIzuH parAvRtya tau pazcAd Agacchantau dRSTvA pRSTavAn yuvAM kiM gavezayathaH? tAvapRcchatAM he rabbi arthAt he guro bhavAn kutra tiSThati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tataH sovAdit etya pazyataM| tato divasasya tRtIyapraharasya gatatvAt tau taddinaM tasya saGge'sthAtAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yau dvau yohano vAkyaM zrutvA yizoH pazcAd AgamatAM tayoH zimonpitarasya bhrAtA AndriyaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>sa itvA prathamaM nijasodaraM zimonaM sAkSAtprApya kathitavAn vayaM khrISTam arthAt abhiSiktapuruSaM sAkSAtkRtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>pazcAt sa taM yizoH samIpam Anayat| tadA yIzustaM dRSTvAvadat tvaM yUnasaH putraH zimon kintu tvannAmadheyaM kaiphAH vA pitaraH arthAt prastaro bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>pare'hani yIzau gAlIlaM gantuM nizcitacetasi sati philipanAmAnaM janaM sAkSAtprApyAvocat mama pazcAd Agaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>baitsaidAnAmni yasmin grAme pitarAndriyayorvAsa AsIt tasmin grAme tasya philipasya vasatirAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>pazcAt philipo nithanelaM sAkSAtprApyAvadat mUsA vyavasthA granthe bhaviSyadvAdinAM grantheSu ca yasyAkhyAnaM likhitamAste taM yUSaphaH putraM nAsaratIyaM yIzuM sAkSAd akArSma vayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA nithanel kathitavAn nAsarannagarAta kiM kazciduttama utpantuM zaknoti? tataH philipo 'vocat etya pazya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>aparaJca yIzuH svasya samIpaM tam AgacchantaM dRSTvA vyAhRtavAn, pazyAyaM niSkapaTaH satya isrAyellokaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tataH sovadad, bhavAn mAM kathaM pratyabhijAnAti? yIzuravAdIt philipasya AhvAnAt pUrvvaM yadA tvamuDumbarasya tarormUle'sthAstadA tvAmadarzam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>nithanel acakathat, he guro bhavAn nitAntam Izvarasya putrosi, bhavAn isrAyelvaMzasya rAjA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tato yIzu rvyAharat, tvAmuDumbarasya pAdapasya mUle dRSTavAnAhaM mamaitasmAdvAkyAt kiM tvaM vyazvasIH? etasmAdapyAzcaryyANi kAryyANi drakSyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>anyaccAvAdId yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, itaH paraM mocite meghadvAre tasmAnmanujasUnunA Izvarasya dUtagaNam avarohantamArohantaJca drakSyatha|</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM trutIyadivase gAlIl pradeziye kAnnAnAmni nagare vivAha AsIt tatra ca yIzormAtA tiSThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tasmai vivAhAya yIzustasya ziSyAzca nimantritA Asan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadanantaraM drAkSArasasya nyUnatvAd yIzormAtA tamavadat eteSAM drAkSAraso nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA sa tAmavocat he nAri mayA saha tava kiM kAryyaM? mama samaya idAnIM nopatiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tatastasya mAtA dAsAnavocad ayaM yad vadati tadeva kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tasmin sthAne yihUdIyAnAM zucitvakaraNavyavahArAnusAreNADhakaikajaladharANi pASANamayAni SaDvRhatpAtrANiAsan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn sarvvakalazAn jalaiH pUrayituM tAnAjJApayat, tataste sarvvAn kumbhAnAkarNaM jalaiH paryyapUrayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>atha tebhyaH kiJciduttAryya bhojyAdhipAteHsamIpaM netuM sa tAnAdizat, te tadanayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>aparaJca tajjalaM kathaM drAkSAraso'bhavat tajjalavAhakAdAsA jJAtuM zaktAH kintu tadbhojyAdhipo jJAtuM nAzaknot tadavalihya varaM saMmbodyAvadata,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>lokAH prathamaM uttamadrAkSArasaM dadati taSu yatheSTaM pitavatsu tasmA kiJcidanuttamaJca dadati kintu tvamidAnIM yAvat uttamadrAkSArasaM sthApayasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>itthaM yIzurgAlIlapradeze AzcaryyakArmma prArambha nijamahimAnaM prAkAzayat tataH ziSyAstasmin vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tataH param sa nijamAtrubhrAtrusziSyaiH sArddhM kapharnAhUmam Agamat kintu tatra bahUdinAni AtiSThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yihUdiyAnAM nistArotsave nikaTamAgate yIzu ryirUzAlam nagaram Agacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tato mandirasya madhye gomeSapArAvatavikrayiNo vANijakScopaviSTAn vilokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>rajjubhiH kazAM nirmmAya sarvvagomeSAdibhiH sArddhaM tAn mandirAd dUrIkRtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>vaNijAM mudrAdi vikIryya AsanAni nyUbjIkRtya pArAvatavikrayibhyo'kathayad asmAt sthAnAt sarvANyetAni nayata, mama pitugRhaM vANijyagRhaM mA kArSTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tasmAt tanmandirArtha udyogo yastu sa grasatIva mAm| imAM zAstrIyalipiM ziSyAHsamasmaran|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH param yihUdIyalokA yISimavadan tavamidRzakarmmakaraNAt kiM cihnamasmAn darzayasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tato yIzustAnavocad yuSmAbhire tasmin mandire nAzite dinatrayamadhye'haM tad utthApayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA yihUdiyA vyAhArSuH, etasya mandirasa nirmmANena SaTcatvAriMzad vatsarA gatAH, tvaM kiM dinatrayamadhye tad utthApayiSyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu sa nijadeharUpamandire kathAmimAM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sa yadetAdRzaM gaditavAn tacchiSyAH zmazAnAt tadIyotthAne sati smRtvA dharmmagranthe yIzunoktakathAyAM ca vyazvasiSuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>anantaraM nistArotsavasya bhojyasamaye yirUzAlam nagare tatkrutAzcaryyakarmmANi vilokya bahubhistasya nAmani vizvasitaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>kintu sa teSAM kareSu svaM na samarpayat, yataH sa sarvvAnavait|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>sa mAnaveSu kasyacit pramANaM nApekSata yato manujAnAM madhye yadyadasti tattat sojAnAt|</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nikadimanAmA yihUdIyAnAm adhipatiH phirUzI kSaNadAyAM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yIzaurabhyarNam Avrajya vyAhArSIt, he guro bhavAn IzvarAd Agat eka upadeSTA, etad asmAbhirjJAyate; yato bhavatA yAnyAzcaryyakarmmANi kriyante paramezvarasya sAhAyyaM vinA kenApi tattatkarmmANi karttuM na zakyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA yIzuruttaraM dattavAn tavAhaM yathArthataraM vyAharAmi punarjanmani na sati kopi mAnava Izvarasya rAjyaM draSTuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tato nikadImaH pratyavocat manujo vRddho bhUtvA kathaM janiSyate? sa kiM puna rmAtRrjaTharaM pravizya janituM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIzuravAdId yathArthataram ahaM kathayAmi manuje toyAtmabhyAM puna rna jAte sa Izvarasya rAjyaM praveSTuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>mAMsAd yat jAyate tan mAMsameva tathAtmano yo jAyate sa Atmaiva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yuSmAbhiH puna rjanitavyaM mamaitasyAM kathAyAm AzcaryaM mA maMsthAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>sadAgatiryAM dizamicchati tasyAmeva dizi vAti, tvaM tasya svanaM zuNoSi kintu sa kuta AyAti kutra yAti vA kimapi na jAnAsi tadvAd AtmanaH sakAzAt sarvveSAM manujAnAM janma bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA nikadImaH pRSTavAn etat kathaM bhavituM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyaktavAn tvamisrAyelo gururbhUtvApi kimetAM kathAM na vetsi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tubhyaM yathArthaM kathayAmi, vayaM yad vidmastad vacmaH yaMcca pazyAmastasyaiva sAkSyaM dadmaH kintu yuSmAbhirasmAkaM sAkSitvaM na gRhyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>etasya saMsArasya kathAyAM kathitAyAM yadi yUyaM na vizvasitha tarhi svargIyAyAM kathAyAM kathaM vizvasiSyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yaH svarge'sti yaM ca svargAd avArohat taM mAnavatanayaM vinA kopi svargaM nArohat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>aparaJca mUsA yathA prAntare sarpaM protthApitavAn manuSyaputro'pi tathaivotthApitavyaH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tasmAd yaH kazcit tasmin vizvasiSyati so'vinAzyaH san anantAyuH prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izvara itthaM jagadadayata yat svamadvitIyaM tanayaM prAdadAt tato yaH kazcit tasmin vizvasiSyati so'vinAzyaH san anantAyuH prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Izvaro jagato lokAn daNDayituM svaputraM na preSya tAn paritrAtuM preSitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ataeva yaH kazcit tasmin vizvasiti sa daNDArho na bhavati kintu yaH kazcit tasmin na vizvasiti sa idAnImeva daNDArho bhavati,yataH sa IzvarasyAdvitIyaputrasya nAmani pratyayaM na karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>jagato madhye jyotiH prAkAzata kintu manuSyANAM karmmaNAM dRSTatvAt te jyotiSopi timire prIyante etadeva daNDasya kAraNAM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yaH kukarmma karoti tasyAcArasya dRSTatvAt sa jyotirRRtIyitvA tannikaTaM nAyAti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu yaH satkarmma karoti tasya sarvvANi karmmANIzvareNa kRtAnIti sathA prakAzate tadabhiprAyeNa sa jyotiSaH sannidhim AyAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH param yIzuH ziSyaiH sArddhaM yihUdIyadezaM gatvA tatra sthitvA majjayitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA zAlam nagarasya samIpasthAyini ainan grAme bahutaratoyasthitestatra yohan amajjayat tathA ca lokA Agatya tena majjitA abhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tadA yohan kArAyAM na baddhaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>aparaJca zAcakarmmaNi yohAnaH ziSyaiH saha yihUdIyalokAnAM vivAde jAte, te yohanaH saMnnidhiM gatvAkathayan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>he guro yarddananadyAH pAre bhavatA sArddhaM ya AsIt yasmiMzca bhavAn sAkSyaM pradadAt pazyatu sopi majjayati sarvve tasya samIpaM yAnti ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tadA yohan pratyavocad IzvareNa na datte kopi manujaH kimapi prAptuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM abhiSikto na bhavAmi kintu tadagre preSitosmi yAmimAM kathAM kathitavAnAhaM tatra yUyaM sarvve sAkSiNaH stha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yo janaH kanyAM labhate sa eva varaH kintu varasya sannidhau daNDAyamAnaM tasya yanmitraM tena varasya zabde zrute'tIvAhlAdyate mamApi tadvad AnandasiddhirjAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tena kramazo varddhitavyaM kintu mayA hsitavyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ya UrdhvAdAgacchat sa sarvveSAM mukhyo yazca saMsArAd udapadyata sa sAMsArikaH saMsArIyAM kathAJca kathayati yastu svargAdAgacchat sa sarvveSAM mukhyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>sa yadapazyadazRNocca tasminneva sAkSyaM dadAti tathApi prAyazaH kazcit tasya sAkSyaM na gRhlAti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kintu yo gRhlAti sa Izvarasya satyavAditvaM mudrAGgitaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>IzvareNa yaH preritaH saeva IzvarIyakathAM kathayati yata Izvara AtmAnaM tasmai aparimitam adadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pitA putre snehaM kRtvA tasya haste sarvvANi samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yaH kazcit putre vizvasiti sa evAnantam paramAyuH prApnoti kintu yaH kazcit putre na vizvasiti sa paramAyuSo darzanaM na prApnoti kintvIzvarasya kopabhAjanaM bhUtvA tiSThati|</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>yIzuH svayaM nAmajjayat kevalaM tasya ziSyA amajjayat kintu yohano'dhikaziSyAn sa karoti majjayati ca,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>phirUzina imAM vArttAmazRNvan iti prabhuravagatya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yihUdIyadezaM vihAya puna rgAlIlam Agat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tataH zomiroNapradezasya madyena tena gantavye sati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yAkUb nijaputrAya yUSaphe yAM bhUmim adadAt tatsamIpasthAyi zomiroNapradezasya sukhAr nAmnA vikhyAtasya nagarasya sannidhAvupAsthAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tatra yAkUbaH prahirAsIt; tadA dvitIyayAmavelAyAM jAtAyAM sa mArge zramApannastasya praheH pArzve upAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>etarhi kAcit zomiroNIyA yoSit toyottolanArtham tatrAgamat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA ziSyAH khAdyadravyANi kretuM nagaram agacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yIzuH zomiroNIyAM tAM yoSitam vyAhArSIt mahyaM kiJcit pAnIyaM pAtuM dehi| kintu zomiroNIyaiH sAkaM yihUdIyalokA na vyavAharan tasmAddhetoH sAkathayat zomiroNIyA yoSitadahaM tvaM yihUdIyosi kathaM mattaH pAnIyaM pAtum icchasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIzuravadad Izvarasya yaddAnaM tatkIdRk pAnIyaM pAtuM mahyaM dehi ya itthaM tvAM yAcate sa vA ka iti cedajJAsyathAstarhi tamayAciSyathAH sa ca tubhyamamRtaM toyamadAsyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadA sA sImantinI bhASitavati, he maheccha prahirgambhIro bhavato nIrottolanapAtraM nAstI ca tasmAt tadamRtaM kIlAlaM kutaH prApsyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yosmabhyam imamandhUM dadau, yasya ca parijanA gomeSAdayazca sarvve'sya praheH pAnIyaM papuretAdRzo yosmAkaM pUrvvapuruSo yAkUb tasmAdapi bhavAn mahAn kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tato yIzurakathayad idaM pAnIyaM saH pivati sa punastRSArtto bhaviSyati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>kintu mayA dattaM pAnIyaM yaH pivati sa punaH kadApi tRSArtto na bhaviSyati| mayA dattam idaM toyaM tasyAntaH prasravaNarUpaM bhUtvA anantAyuryAvat sroSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA sA vanitAkathayat he maheccha tarhi mama punaH pIpAsA yathA na jAyate toyottolanAya yathAtrAgamanaM na bhavati ca tadarthaM mahyaM tattoyaM dehI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato yIzUravadadyAhi tava patimAhUya sthAne'trAgaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>sA vAmAvadat mama patirnAsti| yIzuravadat mama patirnAstIti vAkyaM bhadramavocaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yatastava paJca patayobhavan adhunA tu tvayA sArddhaM yastiSThati sa tava bharttA na vAkyamidaM satyamavAdiH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA sA mahilA gaditavati he maheccha bhavAn eko bhaviSyadvAdIti buddhaM mayA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>asmAkaM pitRlokA etasmin ziloccaye'bhajanta, kintu bhavadbhirucyate yirUzAlam nagare bhajanayogyaM sthAnamAste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yIzuravocat he yoSit mama vAkye vizvasihi yadA yUyaM kevalazaile'smin vA yirUzAlam nagare piturbhajanaM na kariSyadhve kAla etAdRza AyAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yUyaM yaM bhajadhve taM na jAnItha, kintu vayaM yaM bhajAmahe taM jAnImahe, yato yihUdIyalokAnAM madhyAt paritrANaM jAyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>kintu yadA satyabhaktA AtmanA satyarUpeNa ca piturbhajanaM kariSyante samaya etAdRza AyAti, varam idAnImapi vidyate ; yata etAdRzo bhatkAn pitA ceSTate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Izvara AtmA; tatastasya ye bhaktAstaiH sa AtmanA satyarUpeNa ca bhajanIyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sA mahilAvAdIt khrISTanAmnA vikhyAto'bhiSiktaH puruSa AgamiSyatIti jAnAmi sa ca sarvvAH kathA asmAn jJApayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIzuravadat tvayA sArddhaM kathanaM karomi yo'ham ahameva sa puruSaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>etasmin samaye ziSyA Agatya tathA striyA sArddhaM tasya kathopakathane mahAzcaryyam amanyanta tathApi bhavAn kimicchati? yadvA kimartham etayA sArddhaM kathAM kathayati? iti kopi nApRcchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tataH paraM sA nArI kalazaM sthApayitvA nagaramadhyaM gatvA lokebhyokathAyad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>ahaM yadyat karmmAkaravaM tatsarvvaM mahyamakathayad etAdRzaM mAnavamekam Agatya pazyata ru kim abhiSikto na bhavati ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tataste nagarAd bahirAgatya tAtasya samIpam Ayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>etarhi ziSyAH sAdhayitvA taM vyAhArSuH he guro bhavAn kiJcid bhUktAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tataH sovadad yuSmAbhiryanna jJAyate tAdRzaM bhakSyaM mamAste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadA ziSyAH parasparaM praSTum Arambhanta, kimasmai kopi kimapi bhakSyamAnIya dattavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yIzuravocat matprerakasyAbhimatAnurUpakaraNaM tasyaiva karmmasiddhikAraNaJca mama bhakSyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>mAsacatuSTaye jAte zasyakarttanasamayo bhaviSyatIti vAkyaM yuSmAbhiH kiM nodyate? kintvahaM vadAmi, zira uttolya kSetrANi prati nirIkSya pazyata, idAnIM karttanayogyAni zuklavarNAnyabhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yazchinatti sa vetanaM labhate anantAyuHsvarUpaM zasyaM sa gRhlAti ca, tenaiva vaptA chettA ca yugapad AnandataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>itthaM sati vapatyekazchinatyanya iti vacanaM siddhyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>yatra yUyaM na paryyazrAmyata tAdRzaM zasyaM chettuM yuSmAn prairayam anye janAHparyyazrAmyan yUyaM teSAM zragasya phalam alabhadhvam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>yasmin kAle yadyat karmmAkArSaM tatsarvvaM sa mahyam akathayat tasyA vanitAyA idaM sAkSyavAkyaM zrutvA tannagaranivAsino bahavaH zomiroNIyalokA vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tathA ca tasyAntike samupasthAya sveSAM sannidhau katicid dinAni sthAtuM tasmin vinayam akurvvAna tasmAt sa dinadvayaM tatsthAne nyavaSTat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tatastasyopadezena bahavo'pare vizvasya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tAM yoSAmavadan kevalaM tava vAkyena pratIma iti na, kintu sa jagato'bhiSiktastrAteti tasya kathAM zrutvA vayaM svayamevAjJAsamahi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>svadeze bhaviSyadvaktuH satkAro nAstIti yadyapi yIzuH pramANaM datvAkathayat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tathApi divasadvayAt paraM sa tasmAt sthAnAd gAlIlaM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>anantaraM ye gAlIlI liyalokA utsave gatA utsavasamaye yirUzalam nagare tasya sarvvAH kriyA apazyan te gAlIlam AgataM tam AgRhlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tataH param yIzu ryasmin kAnnAnagare jalaM drAkSArasam Akarot tat sthAnaM punaragAt| tasminneva samaye kasyacid rAjasabhAstArasya putraH kapharnAhUmapurI rogagrasta AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>sa yehUdIyadezAd yIzo rgAlIlAgamanavArttAM nizamya tasya samIpaM gatvA prArthya vyAhRtavAn mama putrasya prAyeNa kAla AsannaH bhavAn Agatya taM svasthaM karotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tadA yIzurakathayad AzcaryyaM karmma citraM cihnaM ca na dRSTA yUyaM na pratyeSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tataH sa sabhAsadavadat he maheccha mama putre na mRte bhavAnAgacchatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>yIzustamavadad gaccha tava putro'jIvIt tadA yIzunoktavAkye sa vizvasya gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>gamanakAle mArgamadhye dAsAstaM sAkSAtprApyAvadan bhavataH putro'jIvIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tataH kaM kAlamArabhya rogapratIkArArambho jAtA iti pRSTe tairuktaM hyaH sArddhadaNDadvayAdhikadvitIyayAme tasya jvaratyAgo'bhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tadA yIzustasmin kSaNe proktavAn tava putro'jIvIt pitA tadbuddhvA saparivAro vyazvasIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yihUdIyadezAd Agatya gAlIli yIzuretad dvitIyam AzcaryyakarmmAkarot|</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yihUdIyAnAm utsava upasthite yIzu ryirUzAlamaM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tasminnagare meSanAmno dvArasya samIpe ibrIyabhASayA baithesdA nAmnA piSkariNI paJcaghaTTayuktAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tasyAsteSu ghaTTeSu kilAlakampanam apekSya andhakhaJcazuSkAGgAdayo bahavo rogiNaH patantastiSThanti sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yato vizeSakAle tasya saraso vAri svargIyadUta etyAkampayat tatkIlAlakampanAt paraM yaH kazcid rogI prathamaM pAnIyamavArohat sa eva tatkSaNAd rogamukto'bhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadASTAtriMzadvarSANi yAvad rogagrasta ekajanastasmin sthAne sthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIzustaM zayitaM dRSTvA bahukAlikarogIti jJAtvA vyAhRtavAn tvaM kiM svastho bubhUSasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tato rogI kathitavAn he maheccha yadA kIlAlaM kampate tadA mAM puSkariNIm avarohayituM mama kopi nAsti, tasmAn mama gamanakAle kazcidanyo'gro gatvA avarohati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA yIzurakathayad uttiSTha, tava zayyAmuttolya gRhItvA yAhi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>sa tatkSaNAt svastho bhUtvA zayyAmuttolyAdAya gatavAn kintu taddinaM vizrAmavAraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAH svasthaM naraM vyAharan adya vizrAmavAre zayanIyamAdAya na yAtavyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyavocad yo mAM svastham akArSIt zayanIyam uttolyAdAya yAtuM mAM sa evAdizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan zayanIyam uttolyAdAya yAtuM ya AjJApayat sa kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu sa ka iti svasthIbhUto nAjAnAd yatastasmin sthAne janatAsattvAd yIzuH sthAnAntaram Agamat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH paraM yezu rmandire taM naraM sAkSAtprApyAkathayat pazyedAnIm anAmayo jAtosi yathAdhikA durdazA na ghaTate taddhetoH pApaM karmma punarmAkArSIH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tataH sa gatvA yihUdIyAn avadad yIzu rmAm arogiNam akArSIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato yIzu rvizrAmavAre karmmedRzaM kRtavAn iti heto ryihUdIyAstaM tADayitvA hantum aceSTanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yIzustAnAkhyat mama pitA yat kAryyaM karoti tadanurUpam ahamapi karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyAstaM hantuM punarayatanta yato vizrAmavAraM nAmanyata tadeva kevalaM na adhikantu IzvaraM svapitaraM procya svamapIzvaratulyaM kRtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>pazcAd yIzuravadad yuSmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi putraH pitaraM yadyat karmma kurvvantaM pazyati tadatiriktaM svecchAtaH kimapi karmma karttuM na zaknoti| pitA yat karoti putropi tadeva karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>pitA putre snehaM karoti tasmAt svayaM yadyat karmma karoti tatsarvvaM putraM darzayati ; yathA ca yuSmAkaM AzcaryyajJAnaM janiSyate tadartham itopi mahAkarmma taM darzayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>vastutastu pitA yathA pramitAn utthApya sajivAn karoti tadvat putropi yaM yaM icchati taM taM sajIvaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sarvve pitaraM yathA satkurvvanti tathA putramapi satkArayituM pitA svayaM kasyApi vicAramakRtvA sarvvavicArANAM bhAraM putre samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yaH putraM sat karoti sa tasya prerakamapi sat karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yuSmAnAhaM yathArthataraM vadAmi yo jano mama vAkyaM zrutvA matprerake vizvasiti sonantAyuH prApnoti kadApi daNDabAjanaM na bhavati nidhanAdutthAya paramAyuH prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi yadA mRtA Izvaraputrasya ninAdaM zroSyanti ye ca zroSyanti te sajIvA bhaviSyanti samaya etAdRza AyAti varam idAnImapyupatiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>pitA yathA svayaJjIvI tathA putrAya svayaJjIvitvAdhikAraM dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sa manuSyaputraH etasmAt kAraNAt pitA daNDakaraNAdhikAramapi tasmin samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>etadarthe yUyam AzcaryyaM na manyadhvaM yato yasmin samaye tasya ninAdaM zrutvA zmazAnasthAH sarvve bahirAgamiSyanti samaya etAdRza upasthAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tasmAd ye satkarmmANi kRtavantasta utthAya AyuH prApsyanti ye ca kukarmANi kRtavantasta utthAya daNDaM prApsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>ahaM svayaM kimapi karttuM na zaknomi yathA zuNomi tathA vicArayAmi mama vicAraJca nyAyyaH yatohaM svIyAbhISTaM nehitvA matprerayituH pituriSTam Ihe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>yadi svasmin svayaM sAkSyaM dadAmi tarhi tatsAkSyam AgrAhyaM bhavati ;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kintu madarthe'paro janaH sAkSyaM dadAti madarthe tasya yat sAkSyaM tat satyam etadapyahaM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yuSmAbhi ryohanaM prati lokeSu preriteSu sa satyakathAyAM sAkSyamadadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>mAnuSAdahaM sAkSyaM nopekSe tathApi yUyaM yathA paritrayadhve tadartham idaM vAkyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yohan dedIpyamAno dIpa iva tejasvI sthitavAn yUyam alpakAlaM tasya dIptyAnandituM samamanyadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>kintu tatpramANAdapi mama gurutaraM pramANaM vidyate pitA mAM preSya yadyat karmma samApayituM zakttimadadAt mayA kRtaM tattat karmma madarthe pramANaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yaH pitA mAM preritavAn mopi madarthe pramANaM dadAti| tasya vAkyaM yuSmAbhiH kadApi na zrutaM tasya rUpaJca na dRSTaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tasya vAkyaJca yuSmAkam antaH kadApi sthAnaM nApnoti yataH sa yaM preSitavAn yUyaM tasmin na vizvasitha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>dharmmapustakAni yUyam AlocayadhvaM tai rvAkyairanantAyuH prApsyAma iti yUyaM budhyadhve taddharmmapustakAni madarthe pramANaM dadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tathApi yUyaM paramAyuHprAptaye mama saMnidhim na jigamiSatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>ahaM mAnuSebhyaH satkAraM na gRhlAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAn jAnAmi; yuSmAkamantara Izvaraprema nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>ahaM nijapitu rnAmnAgatosmi tathApi mAM na gRhlItha kintu kazcid yadi svanAmnA samAgamiSyati tarhi taM grahISyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yUyam IzvarAt satkAraM na ciSTatvA kevalaM parasparaM satkAram ced Adadhvve tarhi kathaM vizvasituM zaknutha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>putuH samIpe'haM yuSmAn apavadiSyAmIti mA cintayata yasmin , yasmin yuSmAkaM vizvasaH saeva mUsA yuSmAn apavadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM tasmin vyazvasiSyata tarhi mayyapi vyazvasiSyata, yat sa mayi likhitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tato yadi tena likhitavAni na pratitha tarhi mama vAkyAni kathaM pratyeSyatha?</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzu rgAlIl pradezIyasya tiviriyAnAmnaH sindhoH pAraM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tato vyAdhimallokasvAsthyakaraNarUpANi tasyAzcaryyANi karmmANi dRSTvA bahavo janAstatpazcAd agacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tato yIzuH parvvatamAruhya tatra ziSyaiH sAkam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tasmin samaya nistArotsavanAmni yihUdIyAnAma utsava upasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIzu rnetre uttolya bahulokAn svasamIpAgatAn vilokya philipaM pRSTavAn eteSAM bhojanAya bhojadravyANi vayaM kutra kretuM zakrumaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>vAkyamidaM tasya parIkSArtham avAdIt kintu yat kariSyati tat svayam ajAnAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>philipaH pratyavocat eteSAm ekaiko yadyalpam alpaM prApnoti tarhi mudrApAdadvizatena krItapUpA api nyUnA bhaviSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>zimon pitarasya bhrAtA AndriyAkhyaH ziSyANAmeko vyAhRtavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>atra kasyacid bAlakasya samIpe paJca yAvapUpAH kSudramatsyadvayaJca santi kintu lokAnAM etAvAtAM madhye taiH kiM bhaviSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>pazcAd yIzuravadat lokAnupavezayata tatra bahuyavasasattvAt paJcasahastrebhyo nyUnA adhikA vA puruSA bhUmyAm upAvizan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tato yIzustAn pUpAnAdAya Izvarasya guNAn kIrttayitvA ziSyeSu samArpayat tataste tebhya upaviSTalokebhyaH pUpAn yatheSTamatsyaJca prAduH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>teSu tRpteSu sa tAnavocad eteSAM kiJcidapi yathA nApacIyate tathA sarvvANyavaziSTAni saMgRhlIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tataH sarvveSAM bhojanAt paraM te teSAM paJcAnAM yAvapUpAnAM avaziSTAnyakhilAni saMgRhya dvAdazaDallakAn apUrayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>aparaM yIzoretAdRzIm AzcaryyakriyAM dRSTvA lokA mitho vaktumArebhire jagati yasyAgamanaM bhaviSyati sa evAyam avazyaM bhaviSyadvakttA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>ataeva lokA Agatya tamAkramya rAjAnaM kariSyanti yIzusteSAm IdRzaM mAnasaM vijJAya punazca parvvatam ekAkI gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>sAyaMkAla upasthite ziSyA jaladhitaTaM vrajitvA nAvamAruhya nagaradizi sindhau vAhayitvAgaman|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tasmin samaye timira upAtiSThat kintu yISusteSAM samIpaM nAgacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tadA prabalapavanavahanAt sAgare mahAtaraGgo bhavitum Arebhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataste vAhayitvA dvitrAn krozAn gatAH pazcAd yIzuM jaladherupari padbhyAM vrajantaM naukAntikam AgacchantaM vilokya trAsayuktA abhavan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>kintu sa tAnukttavAn ayamahaM mA bhaiSTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA te taM svairaM nAvi gRhItavantaH tadA tatkSaNAd uddiSTasthAne naurupAsthAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yayA nAvA ziSyA agacchan tadanyA kApi naukA tasmin sthAne nAsIt tato yIzuH ziSyaiH sAkaM nAgamat kevalAH ziSyA agaman etat pArasthA lokA jJAtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>kintu tataH paraM prabhu ryatra Izvarasya guNAn anukIrttya lokAn pUpAn abhojayat tatsthAnasya samIpasthativiriyAyA aparAstaraNaya Agaman|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yIzustatra nAsti ziSyA api tatra nA santi lokA iti vijJAya yIzuM gaveSayituM taraNibhiH kapharnAhUm puraM gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tataste saritpateH pAre taM sAkSAt prApya prAvocan he guro bhavAn atra sthAne kadAgamat?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn pratyavAdId yuSmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi AzcaryyakarmmadarzanAddheto rna kintu pUpabhojanAt tena tRptatvAJca mAM gaveSayatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kSayaNIyabhakSyArthaM mA zrAmiSTa kintvantAyurbhakSyArthaM zrAmyata, tasmAt tAdRzaM bhakSyaM manujaputro yuSmAbhyaM dAsyati; tasmin tAta IzvaraH pramANaM prAdAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan IzvarAbhimataM karmma karttum asmAbhiH kiM karttavyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tato yIzuravadad Izvaro yaM prairayat tasmin vizvasanam IzvarAbhimataM karmma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA te vyAharan bhavatA kiM lakSaNaM darzitaM yaddRSTvA bhavati vizvasiSyAmaH? tvayA kiM karmma kRtaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>asmAkaM pUrvvapuruSA mahAprAntare mAnnAM bhokttuM prApuH yathA lipirAste| svargIyANi tu bhakSyANi pradadau paramezvaraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadad ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi mUsA yuSmAbhyaM svargIyaM bhakSyaM nAdAt kintu mama pitA yuSmAbhyaM svargIyaM paramaM bhakSyaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yaH svargAdavaruhya jagate jIvanaM dadAti sa IzvaradattabhakSyarUpaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA te prAvocan he prabho bhakSyamidaM nityamasmabhyaM dadAtu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yIzuravadad ahameva jIvanarUpaM bhakSyaM yo jano mama sannidhim Agacchati sa jAtu kSudhArtto na bhaviSyati, tathA yo jano mAM pratyeti sa jAtu tRSArtto na bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>mAM dRSTvApi yUyaM na vizvasitha yuSmAnaham ityavocaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>pitA mahyaM yAvato lokAnadadAt te sarvva eva mamAntikam AgamiSyanti yaH kazcicca mama sannidhim AyAsyati taM kenApi prakAreNa na dUrIkariSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>nijAbhimataM sAdhayituM na hi kintu prerayiturabhimataM sAdhayituM svargAd Agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>sa yAn yAn lokAn mahyamadadAt teSAmekamapi na hArayitvA zeSadine sarvvAnaham utthApayAmi idaM matprerayituH piturabhimataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yaH kazcin mAnavasutaM vilokya vizvasiti sa zeSadine mayotthApitaH san anantAyuH prApsyati iti matprerakasyAbhimataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA svargAd yad bhakSyam avArohat tad bhakSyam ahameva yihUdIyalokAstasyaitad vAkye vivadamAnA vakttumArebhire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>yUSaphaH putro yIzu ryasya mAtApitarau vayaM jAnIma eSa kiM saeva na? tarhi svargAd avAroham iti vAkyaM kathaM vaktti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn pratyavadat parasparaM mA vivadadhvaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>matprerakeNa pitrA nAkRSTaH kopi jano mamAntikam AyAtuM na zaknoti kintvAgataM janaM carame'hni protthApayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>te sarvva IzvareNa zikSitA bhaviSyanti bhaviSyadvAdinAM grantheSu lipiritthamAste ato yaH kazcit pituH sakAzAt zrutvA zikSate sa eva mama samIpam AgamiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>ya IzvarAd ajAyata taM vinA kopi manuSyo janakaM nAdarzat kevalaH saeva tAtam adrAkSIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAn yathArthataraM vadAmi yo jano mayi vizvAsaM karoti sonantAyuH prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>ahameva tajjIvanabhakSyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>yuSmAkaM pUrvvapuruSA mahAprAntare mannAbhakSyaM bhUkttApi mRtAH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>kintu yadbhakSyaM svargAdAgacchat tad yadi kazcid bhuGktte tarhi sa na mriyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>yajjIvanabhakSyaM svargAdAgacchat sohameva idaM bhakSyaM yo jano bhuGktte sa nityajIvI bhaviSyati| punazca jagato jIvanArthamahaM yat svakIyapizitaM dAsyAmi tadeva mayA vitaritaM bhakSyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAH parasparaM vivadamAnA vakttumArebhire eSa bhojanArthaM svIyaM palalaM katham asmabhyaM dAsyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn Avocad yuSmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi manuSyaputrasyAmiSe yuSmAbhi rna bhuktte tasya rudhire ca na pIte jIvanena sArddhaM yuSmAkaM sambandho nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yo mamAmiSaM svAdati mama sudhiraJca pivati sonantAyuH prApnoti tataH zeSe'hni tamaham utthApayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>yato madIyamAmiSaM paramaM bhakSyaM tathA madIyaM zoNitaM paramaM peyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yo jano madIyaM palalaM svAdati madIyaM rudhiraJca pivati sa mayi vasati tasminnahaJca vasAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>matprerayitrA jIvatA tAtena yathAhaM jIvAmi tadvad yaH kazcin mAmatti sopi mayA jIviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>yadbhakSyaM svargAdAgacchat tadidaM yanmAnnAM svAditvA yuSmAkaM pitaro'mriyanta tAdRzam idaM bhakSyaM na bhavati idaM bhakSyaM yo bhakSati sa nityaM jIviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>yadA kapharnAhUm puryyAM bhajanagehe upAdizat tadA kathA etA akathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>tadetthaM zrutvA tasya ziSyANAm aneke parasparam akathayan idaM gADhaM vAkyaM vAkyamIdRzaM kaH zrotuM zakruyAt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>kintu yIzuH ziSyANAm itthaM vivAdaM svacitte vijJAya kathitavAn idaM vAkyaM kiM yuSmAkaM vighnaM janayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>yadi manujasutaM pUrvvavAsasthAnam UrdvvaM gacchantaM pazyatha tarhi kiM bhaviSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Atmaiva jIvanadAyakaH vapu rniSphalaM yuSmabhyamahaM yAni vacAMsi kathayAmi tAnyAtmA jIvanaJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>kintu yuSmAkaM madhye kecana avizvAsinaH santi ke ke na vizvasanti ko vA taM parakareSu samarpayiSyati tAn yIzurAprathamAd vetti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>aparamapi kathitavAn asmAt kAraNAd akathayaM pituH sakAzAt zakttimaprApya kopi mamAntikam AgantuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>tatkAle'neke ziSyA vyAghuTya tena sArddhaM puna rnAgacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>tadA yIzu rdvAdazaziSyAn ukttavAn yUyamapi kiM yAsyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>tataH zimon pitaraH pratyavocat he prabho kasyAbhyarNaM gamiSyAmaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>anantajIvanadAyinyo yAH kathAstAstavaiva| bhavAn amarezvarasyAbhiSikttaputra iti vizvasya nizcitaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadat kimahaM yuSmAkaM dvAdazajanAn manonItAn na kRtavAn? kintu yuSmAkaM madhyepi kazcideko vighnakArI vidyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>imAM kathaM sa zimonaH putram ISkarIyotIyaM yihUdAm uddizya kathitavAn yato dvAdazAnAM madhye gaNitaH sa taM parakareSu samarpayiSyati|</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yihUdIyalokAstaM hantuM samaihanta tasmAd yIzu ryihUdApradeze paryyaTituM necchan gAlIl pradeze paryyaTituM prArabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>kintu tasmin samaye yihUdIyAnAM dUSyavAsanAmotsava upasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tasya bhrAtarastam avadan yAni karmmANi tvayA kriyante tAni yathA tava ziSyAH pazyanti tadarthaM tvamitaH sthAnAd yihUdIyadezaM vraja|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yaH kazcit svayaM pracikAziSati sa kadApi guptaM karmma na karoti yadIdRzaM karmma karoSi tarhi jagati nijaM paricAyaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yatastasya bhrAtaropi taM na vizvasanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn avocat mama samaya idAnIM nopatiSThati kintu yuSmAkaM samayaH satatam upatiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>jagato lokA yuSmAn RtIyituM na zakruvanti kintu mAmeva RtIyante yatasteSAM karmANi duSTAni tatra sAkSyamidam ahaM dadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>ataeva yUyam utsave'smin yAta nAham idAnIm asminnutsave yAmi yato mama samaya idAnIM na sampUrNaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>iti vAkyam ukttvA sa gAlIli sthitavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kintu tasya bhrAtRSu tatra prasthiteSu satsu so'prakaTa utsavam agacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>anantaram utsavam upasthitA yihUdIyAstaM mRgayitvApRcchan sa kutra?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tato lokAnAM madhye tasmin nAnAvidhA vivAdA bhavitum ArabdhavantaH| kecid avocan sa uttamaH puruSaH kecid avocan na tathA varaM lokAnAM bhramaM janayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu yihUdIyAnAM bhayAt kopi tasya pakSe spaSTaM nAkathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH param utsavasya madhyasamaye yIzu rmandiraM gatvA samupadizati sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyA lokA AzcaryyaM jJAtvAkathayan eSA mAnuSo nAdhItyA katham etAdRzo vidvAnabhUt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyavocad upadezoyaM na mama kintu yo mAM preSitavAn tasya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yo jano nidezaM tasya grahISyati mamopadezo matto bhavati kim IzvarAd bhavati sa ganastajjJAtuM zakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yo janaH svataH kathayati sa svIyaM gauravam Ihate kintu yaH prerayitu rgauravam Ihate sa satyavAdI tasmin kopyadharmmo nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>mUsA yuSmabhyaM vyavasthAgranthaM kiM nAdadAt? kintu yuSmAkaM kopi tAM vyavasthAM na samAcarati| mAM hantuM kuto yatadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA lokA avadan tvaM bhUtagrastastvAM hantuM ko yatate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tato yIzuravocad ekaM karmma mayAkAri tasmAd yUyaM sarvva mahAzcaryyaM manyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>mUsA yuSmabhyaM tvakchedavidhiM pradadau sa mUsAto na jAtaH kintu pitRpuruSebhyo jAtaH tena vizrAmavAre'pi mAnuSANAM tvakchedaM kurutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>ataeva vizrAmavAre manuSyANAM tvakchede kRte yadi mUsAvyavasthAmaGganaM na bhavati tarhi mayA vizrAmavAre mAnuSaH sampUrNarUpeNa svastho'kAri tatkAraNAd yUyaM kiM mahyaM kupyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>sapakSapAtaM vicAramakRtvA nyAyyaM vicAraM kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yirUzAlam nivAsinaH katipayajanA akathayan ime yaM hantuM ceSTante sa evAyaM kiM na?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintu pazyata nirbhayaH san kathAM kathayati tathApi kimapi a vadantyete ayamevAbhiSiktto bhavatIti nizcitaM kimadhipatayo jAnanti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>manujoyaM kasmAdAgamad iti vayaM jAnomaH kintvabhiSiktta Agate sa kasmAdAgatavAn iti kopi jJAtuM na zakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA yIzu rmadhyemandiram upadizan uccaiHkAram ukttavAn yUyaM kiM mAM jAnItha? kasmAccAgatosmi tadapi kiM jAnItha? nAhaM svata Agatosmi kintu yaH satyavAdI saeva mAM preSitavAn yUyaM taM na jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tamahaM jAne tenAhaM prerita agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAstaM dharttum udyatAstathApi kopi tasya gAtre hastaM nArpayad yato hetostadA tasya samayo nopatiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintu bahavo lokAstasmin vizvasya kathitavAnto'bhiSikttapuruSa Agatya mAnuSasyAsya kriyAbhyaH kim adhikA AzcaryyAH kriyAH kariSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tataH paraM lokAstasmin itthaM vivadante phirUzinaH pradhAnayAjakAJceti zrutavantastaM dhRtvA netuM padAtigaNaM preSayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tato yIzuravadad aham alpadinAni yuSmAbhiH sArddhaM sthitvA matprerayituH samIpaM yAsyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>mAM mRgayiSyadhve kintUddezaM na lapsyadhve ratra sthAsyAmi tatra yUyaM gantuM na zakSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH parasparaM vakttumArebhire asyoddezaM na prApsyAma etAdRzaM kiM sthAnaM yAsyati? bhinnadeze vikIrNAnAM yihUdIyAnAM sannidhim eSa gatvA tAn upadekSyati kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>no cet mAM gaveSayiSyatha kintUddezaM na prApsyatha eSa kodRzaM vAkyamidaM vadati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>anantaram utsavasya carame'hani arthAt pradhAnadine yIzuruttiSThan uccaiHkAram Ahvayan uditavAn yadi kazcit tRSArtto bhavati tarhi mamAntikam Agatya pivatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>yaH kazcinmayi vizvasiti dharmmagranthasya vacanAnusAreNa tasyAbhyantarato'mRtatoyasya srotAMsi nirgamiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>ye tasmin vizvasanti ta AtmAnaM prApsyantItyarthe sa idaM vAkyaM vyAhRtavAn etatkAlaM yAvad yIzu rvibhavaM na prAptastasmAt pavitra AtmA nAdIyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>etAM vANIM zrutvA bahavo lokA avadan ayameva nizcitaM sa bhaviSyadvAdI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>kecid akathayan eSaeva sobhiSikttaH kintu kecid avadan sobhiSikttaH kiM gAlIl pradeze janiSyate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>sobhiSiktto dAyUdo vaMze dAyUdo janmasthAne baitlehami pattane janiSyate dharmmagranthe kimitthaM likhitaM nAsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>itthaM tasmin lokAnAM bhinnavAkyatA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>katipayalokAstaM dharttum aicchan tathApi tadvapuSi kopi hastaM nArpayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>anantaraM pAdAtigaNe pradhAnayAjakAnAM phirUzinAJca samIpamAgatavati te tAn apRcchan kuto hetostaM nAnayata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA padAtayaH pratyavadan sa mAnava iva kopi kadApi nopAdizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tataH phirUzinaH prAvocan yUyamapi kimabhrAmiSTa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>adhipatInAM phirUzinAJca kopi kiM tasmin vyazvasIt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>ye zAstraM na jAnanti ta ime'dhamalokAeva zApagrastAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tadA nikadImanAmA teSAmeko yaH kSaNadAyAM yIzoH sannidhim agAt sa ukttavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>tasya vAkye na zrute karmmaNi ca na vidite 'smAkaM vyavasthA kiM kaJcana manujaM doSIkaroti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tataste vyAharan tvamapi kiM gAlIlIyalokaH? vivicya pazya galIli kopi bhaviSyadvAdI notpadyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tataH paraM sarvve svaM svaM gRhaM gatAH kintu yIzu rjaitunanAmAnaM ziloccayaM gatavAn|</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>pratyUSe yIzuH panarmandiram Agacchat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tataH sarvveSu lokeSu tasya samIpa AgateSu sa upavizya tAn upadeSTum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA adhyApakAH phirUzinaJca vyabhicArakarmmaNi dhRtaM striyamekAm Aniya sarvveSAM madhye sthApayitvA vyAharan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>he guro yoSitam imAM vyabhicArakarmma kurvvANAM lokA dhRtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>etAdRzalokAH pASANAghAtena hantavyA iti vidhirmUsAvyavasthAgranthe likhitosti kintu bhavAn kimAdizati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>te tamapavadituM parIkSAbhiprAyeNa vAkyamidam apRcchan kintu sa prahvIbhUya bhUmAvaGgalyA lekhitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tatastaiH punaH punaH pRSTa utthAya kathitavAn yuSmAkaM madhye yo jano niraparAdhI saeva prathamam enAM pASANenAhantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>pazcAt sa punazca prahvIbhUya bhUmau lekhitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tAM kathaM zrutvA te svasvamanasi prabodhaM prApya jyeSThAnukramaM ekaikazaH sarvve bahiragacchan tato yIzurekAkI tayakttobhavat madhyasthAne daNDAyamAnA sA yoSA ca sthitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tatpazcAd yIzurutthAya tAM vanitAM vinA kamapyaparaM na vilokya pRSTavAn he vAme tavApavAdakAH kutra? kopi tvAM kiM na daNDayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>sAvadat he maheccha kopi na tadA yIzuravocat nAhamapi daNDayAmi yAhi punaH pApaM mAkArSIH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tato yIzuH punarapi lokebhya itthaM kathayitum Arabhata jagatohaM jyotiHsvarUpo yaH kazcin matpazcAda gacchati sa timire na bhramitvA jIvanarUpAM dIptiM prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tataH phirUzino'vAdiSustvaM svArthe svayaM sAkSyaM dadAsi tasmAt tava sAkSyaM grAhyaM na bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyuditavAn yadyapi svArthe'haM svayaM sAkSyaM dadAmi tathApi mat sAkSyaM grAhyaM yasmAd ahaM kuta Agatosmi kva yAmi ca tadahaM jAnAmi kintu kuta Agatosmi kutra gacchAmi ca tad yUyaM na jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yUyaM laukikaM vicArayatha nAhaM kimapi vicArayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kintu yadi vicArayAmi tarhi mama vicAro grahItavyo yatoham ekAkI nAsmi prerayitA pitA mayA saha vidyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>dvayo rjanayoH sAkSyaM grahaNIyaM bhavatIti yuSmAkaM vyavasthAgranthe likhitamasti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM svArthe svayaM sAkSitvaM dadAmi yazca mama tAto mAM preritavAn sopi madarthe sAkSyaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA te'pRcchan tava tAtaH kutra? tato yIzuH pratyavAdId yUyaM mAM na jAnItha matpitaraJca na jAnItha yadi mAm akSAsyata tarhi mama tAtamapyakSAsyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yIzu rmandira upadizya bhaNDAgAre kathA etA akathayat tathApi taM prati kopi karaM nodatolayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzuH punaruditavAn adhunAhaM gacchAmi yUyaM mAM gaveSayiSyatha kintu nijaiH pApai rmariSyatha yat sthAnam ahaM yAsyAmi tat sthAnam yUyaM yAtuM na zakSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH prAvocan kimayam AtmaghAtaM kariSyati? yato yat sthAnam ahaM yAsyAmi tat sthAnam yUyaM yAtuM na zakSyatha iti vAkyaM bravIti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIzustebhyaH kathitavAn yUyam adhaHsthAnIyA lokA aham UrdvvasthAnIyaH yUyam etajjagatsambandhIyA aham etajjagatsambandhIyo na|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasmAt kathitavAn yUyaM nijaiH pApai rmariSyatha yatohaM sa pumAn iti yadi na vizvasitha tarhi nijaiH pApai rmariSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA te 'pRcchan kastvaM? tato yIzuH kathitavAn yuSmAkaM sannidhau yasya prastAvam A prathamAt karomi saeva puruSohaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yuSmAsu mayA bahuvAkyaM vakttavyaM vicArayitavyaJca kintu matprerayitA satyavAdI tasya samIpe yadahaM zrutavAn tadeva jagate kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu sa janake vAkyamidaM prokttavAn iti te nAbudhyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tato yIzurakathayad yadA manuSyaputram Urdvva utthApayiSyatha tadAhaM sa pumAn kevalaH svayaM kimapi karmma na karomi kintu tAto yathA zikSayati tadanusAreNa vAkyamidaM vadAmIti ca yUyaM jJAtuM zakSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>matprerayitA pitA mAm ekAkinaM na tyajati sa mayA sArddhaM tiSThati yatohaM tadabhimataM karmma sadA karomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA tasyaitAni vAkyAni zrutvA bahuvastAsmin vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ye yihUdIyA vyazvasan yIzustebhyo'kathayat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>mama vAkye yadi yUyam AsthAM kurutha tarhi mama ziSyA bhUtvA satyatvaM jJAsyatha tataH satyatayA yuSmAkaM mokSo bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadA te pratyavAdiSuH vayam ibrAhImo vaMzaH kadApi kasyApi dAsA na jAtAstarhi yuSmAkaM muktti rbhaviSyatIti vAkyaM kathaM bravISi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyavadad yuSmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi yaH pApaM karoti sa pApasya dAsaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>dAsazca nirantaraM nivezane na tiSThati kintu putro nirantaraM tiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataH putro yadi yuSmAn mocayati tarhi nitAntameva mukttA bhaviSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yuyam ibrAhImo vaMza ityahaM jAnAmi kintu mama kathA yuSmAkam antaHkaraNeSu sthAnaM na prApnuvanti tasmAddheto rmAM hantum Ihadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>ahaM svapituH samIpe yadapazyaM tadeva kathayAmi tathA yUyamapi svapituH samIpe yadapazyata tadeva kurudhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA te pratyavocan ibrAhIm asmAkaM pitA tato yIzurakathayad yadi yUyam ibrAhImaH santAnA abhaviSyata tarhi ibrAhIma AcAraNavad AcariSyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Izvarasya mukhAt satyaM vAkyaM zrutvA yuSmAn jJApayAmi yohaM taM mAM hantuM ceSTadhve ibrAhIm etAdRzaM karmma na cakAra|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>yUyaM svasvapituH karmmANi kurutha tadA tairukttaM na vayaM jArajAtA asmAkam ekaeva pitAsti sa evezvaraH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tato yIzunA kathitam Izvaro yadi yuSmAkaM tAtobhaviSyat tarhi yUyaM mayi premAkariSyata yatoham IzvarAnnirgatyAgatosmi svato nAgatohaM sa mAM prAhiNot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>yUyaM mama vAkyamidaM na budhyadhve kutaH? yato yUyaM mamopadezaM soDhuM na zaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yUyaM zaitAn pituH santAnA etasmAd yuSmAkaM piturabhilASaM pUrayatha sa A prathamAt naraghAtI tadantaH satyatvasya lezopi nAsti kAraNAdataH sa satyatAyAM nAtiSThat sa yadA mRSA kathayati tadA nijasvabhAvAnusAreNaiva kathayati yato sa mRSAbhASI mRSotpAdakazca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>ahaM tathyavAkyaM vadAmi kAraNAdasmAd yUyaM mAM na pratItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>mayi pApamastIti pramANaM yuSmAkaM ko dAtuM zaknoti? yadyahaM tathyavAkyaM vadAmi tarhi kuto mAM na pratitha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>yaH kazcana IzvarIyo lokaH sa IzvarIyakathAyAM mano nidhatte yUyam IzvarIyalokA na bhavatha tannidAnAt tatra na manAMsi nidhadve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH pratyavAdiSuH tvamekaH zomiroNIyo bhUtagrastazca vayaM kimidaM bhadraM nAvAdiSma?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyavAdIt nAhaM bhUtagrastaH kintu nijatAtaM sammanye tasmAd yUyaM mAm apamanyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>ahaM svasukhyAtiM na ceSTe kintu ceSTitA vicArayitA cApara eka Aste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmabhyam atIva yathArthaM kathayAmi yo naro madIyaM vAcaM manyate sa kadAcana nidhanaM na drakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>yihUdIyAstamavadan tvaM bhUtagrasta itIdAnIm avaiSma| ibrAhIm bhaviSyadvAdinaJca sarvve mRtAH kintu tvaM bhASase yo naro mama bhAratIM gRhlAti sa jAtu nidhAnAsvAdaM na lapsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tarhi tvaM kim asmAkaM pUrvvapuruSAd ibrAhImopi mahAn? yasmAt sopi mRtaH bhaviSyadvAdinopi mRtAH tvaM svaM kaM pumAMsaM manuSe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyavocad yadyahaM svaM svayaM sammanye tarhi mama tat sammananaM kimapi na kintu mama tAto yaM yUyaM svIyam IzvaraM bhASadhve saeva mAM sammanute|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>yUyaM taM nAvagacchatha kintvahaM tamavagacchAmi taM nAvagacchAmIti vAkyaM yadi vadAmi tarhi yUyamiva mRSAbhASI bhavAmi kintvahaM tamavagacchAmi tadAkSAmapi gRhlAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yuSmAkaM pUrvvapuruSa ibrAhIm mama samayaM draSTum atIvAvAJchat tannirIkSyAnandacca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyA apRcchan tava vayaH paJcAzadvatsarA na tvaM kim ibrAhImam adrAkSIH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyavAdId yuSmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi ibrAhImo janmanaH pUrvvakAlamArabhyAhaM vidye|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>tadA te pASANAn uttolya tamAhantum udayacchan kintu yIzu rgupto mantirAd bahirgatya teSAM madhyena prasthitavAn|</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzurgacchan mArgamadhye janmAndhaM naram apazyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tataH ziSyAstam apRcchan he guro naroyaM svapApena vA svapitrAH pApenAndho'jAyata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyuditavAn etasya vAsya pitroH pApAd etAdRzobhUda iti nahi kintvanena yathezvarasya karmma prakAzyate taddhetoreva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>dine tiSThati matprerayituH karmma mayA karttavyaM yadA kimapi karmma na kriyate tAdRzI nizAgacchati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ahaM yAvatkAlaM jagati tiSThAmi tAvatkAlaM jagato jyotiHsvarUposmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>ityukttA bhUmau niSThIvaM nikSipya tena paGkaM kRtavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>pazcAt tatpaGkena tasyAndhasya netre pralipya tamityAdizat gatvA zilohe 'rthAt preritanAmni sarasi snAhi| tatondho gatvA tatrAsnAt tataH prannacakSu rbhUtvA vyAghuTyAgAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>aparaJca samIpavAsino lokA ye ca taM pUrvvamandham apazyan te bakttum Arabhanta yondhaloko vartmanyupavizyAbhikSata sa evAyaM janaH kiM na bhavati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>kecidavadan sa eva kecidavocan tAdRzo bhavati kintu sa svayamabravIt sa evAhaM bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ataeva te 'pRcchan tvaM kathaM dRSTiM pAptavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH sovadad yIzanAmaka eko jano mama nayane paGkena pralipya ityAjJApayat zilohakAsAraM gatvA tatra snAhi| tatastatra gatvA mayi snAte dRSTimahaM labdhavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA te 'vadan sa pumAn kutra? tenokttaM nAhaM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>aparaM tasmin pUrvvAndhe jane phirUzinAM nikaTam AnIte sati phirUzinopi tamapRcchan kathaM dRSTiM prAptosi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH sa kathitavAn sa paGkena mama netre 'limpat pazcAd snAtvA dRSTimalabhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu yIzu rvizrAmavAre karddamaM kRtvA tasya nayane prasanne'karod itikAraNAt katipayaphirUzino'vadan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>sa pumAn IzvarAnna yataH sa vizrAmavAraM na manyate| tatonye kecit pratyavadan pApI pumAn kim etAdRzam AzcaryyaM karmma karttuM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>itthaM teSAM parasparaM bhinnavAkyatvam abhavat| pazcAt te punarapi taM pUrvvAndhaM mAnuSam aprAkSuH yo janastava cakSuSI prasanne kRtavAn tasmin tvaM kiM vadasi? sa ukttavAn sa bhavizadvAdI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sa dRSTim AptavAn iti yihUdIyAstasya dRSTiM prAptasya janasya pitro rmukhAd azrutvA na pratyayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>ataeva te tAvapRcchan yuvayo ryaM putraM janmAndhaM vadathaH sa kimayaM? tarhIdAnIM kathaM draSTuM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tatastasya pitarau pratyavocatAm ayam AvayoH putra A janerandhazca tadapyAvAM jAnIvaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintvadhunA kathaM dRSTiM prAptavAn tadAvAM n jAnIvaH kosya cakSuSI prasanne kRtavAn tadapi na jAnIva eSa vayaHprApta enaM pRcchata svakathAM svayaM vakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAM bhayAt tasya pitarau vAkyamidam avadatAM yataH kopi manuSyo yadi yIzum abhiSiktaM vadati tarhi sa bhajanagRhAd dUrIkAriSyate yihUdIyA iti mantraNAm akurvvan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>atastasya pitarau vyAharatAm eSa vayaHprApta enaM pRcchata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tadA te punazca taM pUrvvAndham AhUya vyAharan Izvarasya guNAn vada eSa manuSyaH pApIti vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sa ukttavAn sa pApI na veti nAhaM jAne pUrvAmandha Asamaham adhunA pazyAmIti mAtraM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>te punarapRcchan sa tvAM prati kimakarot? kathaM netre prasanne 'karot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tataH sovAdId ekakRtvokathayaM yUyaM na zRNutha tarhi kutaH punaH zrotum icchatha? yUyamapi kiM tasya ziSyA bhavitum icchatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA te taM tiraskRtya vyAharan tvaM tasya ziSyo vayaM mUsAH ziSyAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>mUsAvaktreNezvaro jagAda tajjAnImaH kintveSa kutratyaloka iti na jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>sovadad eSa mama locane prasanne 'karot tathApi kutratyaloka iti yUyaM na jAnItha etad AzcaryyaM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>IzvaraH pApinAM kathAM na zRNoti kintu yo janastasmin bhaktiM kRtvA tadiSTakriyAM karoti tasyaiva kathAM zRNoti etad vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kopi manuSyo janmAndhAya cakSuSI adadAt jagadArambhAd etAdRzIM kathAM kopi kadApi nAzRNot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>asmAd eSa manuSyo yadIzvarAnnAjAyata tarhi kiJcidapIdRzaM karmma karttuM nAzaknot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>te vyAharan tvaM pApAd ajAyathAH kimasmAn tvaM zikSayasi? pazcAtte taM bahirakurvvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yihUdIyaiH sa bahirakriyata yIzuriti vArttAM zrutvA taM sAkSAt prApya pRSTavAn Izvarasya putre tvaM vizvasiSi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tadA sa pratyavocat he prabho sa ko yat tasminnahaM vizvasimi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tato yIzuH kathitavAn tvaM taM dRSTavAn tvayA sAkaM yaH kathaM kathayati saeva saH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA he prabho vizvasimItyuktvA sa taM praNAmat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>pazcAd yIzuH kathitavAn nayanahInA nayanAni prApnuvanti nayanavantazcAndhA bhavantItyabhiprAyeNa jagadAham Agaccham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>etat zrutvA nikaTasthAH katipayAH phirUzino vyAharan vayamapi kimandhAH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravAdId yadyandhA abhavata tarhi pApAni nAtiSThan kintu pazyAmIti vAkyavadanAd yuSmAkaM pApAni tiSThanti|</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, yo jano dvAreNa na pravizya kenApyanyena meSagRhaM pravizati sa eva steno dasyuzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yo dvAreNa pravizati sa eva meSapAlakaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>dauvArikastasmai dvAraM mocayati meSagaNazca tasya vAkyaM zRNoti sa nijAn meSAn svasvanAmnAhUya bahiH kRtvA nayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tathA nijAn meSAn bahiH kRtvA svayaM teSAm agre gacchati, tato meSAstasya zabdaM budhyante, tasmAt tasya pazcAd vrajanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>kintu parasya zabdaM na budhyante tasmAt tasya pazcAd vrajiSyanti varaM tasya samIpAt palAyiSyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIzustebhya imAM dRSTAntakathAm akathayat kintu tena kathitakathAyAstAtparyyaM te nAbudhyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>ato yIzuH punarakathayat, yuSmAnAhaM yathArthataraM vyAharAmi, meSagRhasya dvAram ahameva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>mayA na pravizya ya Agacchan te stenA dasyavazca kintu meSAsteSAM kathA nAzRNvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>ahameva dvArasvarUpaH, mayA yaH kazcita pravizati sa rakSAM prApsyati tathA bahirantazca gamanAgamane kRtvA caraNasthAnaM prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yo janastenaH sa kevalaM stainyabadhavinAzAn karttumeva samAyAti kintvaham Ayu rdAtum arthAt bAhUlyena tadeva dAtum Agaccham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ahameva satyameSapAlako yastu satyo meSapAlakaH sa meSArthaM prANatyAgaM karoti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>kintu yo jano meSapAlako na, arthAd yasya meSA nijA na bhavanti, ya etAdRzo vaitanikaH sa vRkam AgacchantaM dRSTvA mejavrajaM vihAya palAyate, tasmAd vRkastaM vrajaM dhRtvA vikirati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>vaitanikaH palAyate yataH sa vetanArthI meSArthaM na cintayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ahameva satyo meSapAlakaH, pitA mAM yathA jAnAti, ahaJca yathA pitaraM jAnAmi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tathA nijAn meSAnapi jAnAmi, meSAzca mAM jAnAnti, ahaJca meSArthaM prANatyAgaM karomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>aparaJca etad gRhIya meSebhyo bhinnA api meSA mama santi te sakalA AnayitavyAH; te mama zabdaM zroSyanti tata eko vraja eko rakSako bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>prANAnahaM tyaktvA punaH prANAn grahISyAmi, tasmAt pitA mayi snehaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>kazcijjano mama prANAn hantuM na zaknoti kintu svayaM tAn samarpayAmi tAn samarpayituM punargrahItuJca mama zaktirAste bhAramimaM svapituH sakAzAt prAptoham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>asmAdupadezAt punazca yihUdIyAnAM madhye bhinnavAkyatA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tato bahavo vyAharan eSa bhUtagrasta unmattazca, kuta etasya kathAM zRNutha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kecid avadan etasya kathA bhUtagrastasya kathAvanna bhavanti, bhUtaH kim andhAya cakSuSI dAtuM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>zItakAle yirUzAlami mandirotsargaparvvaNyupasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yIzuH sulemAno niHsAreNa gamanAgamane karoti,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>etasmin samaye yihUdIyAstaM veSTayitvA vyAharan kati kAlAn asmAkaM vicikitsAM sthApayiSyAmi? yadyabhiSikto bhavati tarhi tat spaSTaM vada|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyavadad aham acakathaM kintu yUyaM na pratItha, nijapitu rnAmnA yAM yAM kriyAM karomi sA kriyaiva mama sAkSisvarUpA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintvahaM pUrvvamakathayaM yUyaM mama meSA na bhavatha, kAraNAdasmAn na vizvasitha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>mama meSA mama zabdaM zRNvanti tAnahaM jAnAmi te ca mama pazcAd gacchanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM tebhyo'nantAyu rdadAmi, te kadApi na naMkSyanti kopi mama karAt tAn harttuM na zakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yo mama pitA tAn mahyaM dattavAn sa sarvvasmAt mahAn, kopi mama pituH karAt tAn harttuM na zakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>ahaM pitA ca dvayorekatvam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyAH punarapi taM hantuM pASANAn udatolayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yIzuH kathitavAn pituH sakAzAd bahUnyuttamakarmmANi yuSmAkaM prAkAzayaM teSAM kasya karmmaNaH kAraNAn mAM pASANairAhantum udyatAH stha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yihUdIyAH pratyavadan prazastakarmmaheto rna kintu tvaM mAnuSaH svamIzvaram uktvezvaraM nindasi kAraNAdasmAt tvAM pASANairhanmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyuktavAn mayA kathitaM yUyam IzvarA etadvacanaM yuSmAkaM zAstre likhitaM nAsti kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tasmAd yeSAm uddeze Izvarasya kathA kathitA te yadIzvaragaNA ucyante dharmmagranthasyApyanyathA bhavituM na zakyaM,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tarhyAham Izvarasya putra iti vAkyasya kathanAt yUyaM pitrAbhiSiktaM jagati preritaJca pumAMsaM katham IzvaranindakaM vAdaya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yadyahaM pituH karmma na karomi tarhi mAM na pratIta;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>kintu yadi karomi tarhi mayi yuSmAbhiH pratyaye na kRte'pi kAryye pratyayaH kriyatAM, tato mayi pitAstIti pitaryyaham asmIti ca kSAtvA vizvasiSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA te punarapi taM dharttum aceSTanta kintu sa teSAM karebhyo nistIryya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>puna ryarddan adyAstaTe yatra purvvaM yohan amajjayat tatrAgatya nyavasat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tato bahavo lokAstatsamIpam Agatya vyAharan yohan kimapyAzcaryyaM karmma nAkarot kintvasmin manuSye yA yaH kathA akathayat tAH sarvvAH satyAH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tatra ca bahavo lokAstasmin vyazvasan|</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM mariyam tasyA bhaginI marthA ca yasmin vaithanIyAgrAme vasatastasmin grAme iliyAsar nAmA pIDita eka AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yA mariyam prabhuM sugandhitelaina marddayitvA svakezaistasya caraNau samamArjat tasyA bhrAtA sa iliyAsar rogI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>aparaJca he prabho bhavAn yasmin prIyate sa eva pIDitostIti kathAM kathayitvA tasya bhaginyau preSitavatyau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA yIzurimAM vArttAM zrutvAkathayata pIDeyaM maraNArthaM na kintvIzvarasya mahimArtham Izvaraputrasya mahimaprakAzArthaJca jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIzu ryadyapimarthAyAM tadbhaginyAm iliyAsari cAprIyata,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tathApi iliyAsaraH pIDAyAH kathaM zrutvA yatra AsIt tatraiva dinadvayamatiSThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tataH param sa ziSyAnakathayad vayaM puna ryihUdIyapradezaM yAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataste pratyavadan, he guro svalpadinAni gatAni yihUdIyAstvAM pASANai rhantum udyatAstathApi kiM punastatra yAsyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyavadat, ekasmin dine kiM dvAdazaghaTikA na bhavanti? kopi divA gacchan na skhalati yataH sa etajjagato dIptiM prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kintu rAtrau gacchan skhalati yato hetostatra dIpti rnAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>imAM kathAM kathayitvA sa tAnavadad, asmAkaM bandhuH iliyAsar nidritobhUd idAnIM taM nidrAto jAgarayituM gacchAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yIzu rmRtau kathAmimAM kathitavAn kintu vizrAmArthaM nidrAyAM kathitavAn iti jJAtvA ziSyA akathayan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>he guro sa yadi nidrAti tarhi bhadrameva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH spaSTaM tAn vyAharat, iliyAsar amriyata;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu yUyaM yathA pratItha tadarthamahaM tatra na sthitavAn ityasmAd yuSmannimittam AhlAditohaM, tathApi tasya samIpe yAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA thomA yaM didumaM vadanti sa saGginaH ziSyAn avadad vayamapi gatvA tena sArddhaM mriyAmahai|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yIzustatropasthAya iliyAsaraH zmazAne sthApanAt catvAri dinAni gatAnIti vArttAM zrutavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>vaithanIyA yirUzAlamaH samIpasthA krozaikamAtrAntaritA;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tasmAd bahavo yihUdIyA marthAM mariyamaJca bhyAtRzokApannAM sAntvayituM tayoH samIpam Agacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>marthA yIzorAgamanavArtAM zrutvaiva taM sAkSAd akarot kintu mariyam geha upavizya sthitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA marthA yIzumavAdat, he prabho yadi bhavAn atrAsthAsyat tarhi mama bhrAtA nAmariSyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>kintvidAnImapi yad Izvare prArthayiSyate Izvarastad dAsyatIti jAne'haM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yIzuravAdIt tava bhrAtA samutthAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>marthA vyAharat zeSadivase sa utthAnasamaye protthAsyatIti jAne'haM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH kathitavAn ahameva utthApayitA jIvayitA ca yaH kazcana mayi vizvasiti sa mRtvApi jIviSyati;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yaH kazcana ca jIvan mayi vizvasiti sa kadApi na mariSyati, asyAM kathAyAM kiM vizvasiSi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sAvadat prabho yasyAvataraNApekSAsti bhavAn saevAbhiSiktta Izvaraputra iti vizvasimi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>iti kathAM kathayitvA sA gatvA svAM bhaginIM mariyamaM guptamAhUya vyAharat gururupatiSThati tvAmAhUyati ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kathAmimAM zrutvA sA tUrNam utthAya tasya samIpam agacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yIzu rgrAmamadhyaM na pravizya yatra marthA taM sAkSAd akarot tatra sthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ye yihUdIyA mariyamA sAkaM gRhe tiSThantastAm asAntvayana te tAM kSipram utthAya gacchantiM vilokya vyAharan, sa zmazAne rodituM yAti, ityuktvA te tasyAH pazcAd agacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yatra yIzuratiSThat tatra mariyam upasthAya taM dRSTvA tasya caraNayoH patitvA vyAharat he prabho yadi bhavAn atrAsthAsyat tarhi mama bhrAtA nAmariSyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yIzustAM tasyAH saGgino yihUdIyAMzca rudato vilokya zokArttaH san dIrghaM nizvasya kathitavAn taM kutrAsthApayata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>te vyAharan, he prabho bhavAn Agatya pazyatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yIzunA kranditaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataeva yihUdIyA avadan, pazyatAyaM tasmin kidRg apriyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>teSAM kecid avadan yondhAya cakSuSI dattavAn sa kim asya mRtyuM nivArayituM nAzaknot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIzuH punarantardIrghaM nizvasya zmazAnAntikam agacchat| tat zmazAnam ekaM gahvaraM tanmukhe pASANa eka AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadad enaM pASANam apasArayata, tataH pramItasya bhaginI marthAvadat prabho, adhunA tatra durgandho jAtaH, yatodya catvAri dinAni zmazAne sa tiSThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravAdIt, yadi vizvasiSi tarhIzvarasya mahimaprakAzaM drakSyasi kathAmimAM kiM tubhyaM nAkathayaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA mRtasya zmazAnAt pASANo'pasArite yIzurUrdvvaM pazyan akathayat, he pita rmama nevesanam azRNoH kAraNAdasmAt tvAM dhanyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tvaM satataM zRNoSi tadapyahaM jAnAmi, kintu tvaM mAM yat prairayastad yathAsmin sthAne sthitA lokA vizvasanti tadartham idaM vAkyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>imAM kathAM kathayitvA sa proccairAhvayat, he iliyAsar bahirAgaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tataH sa pramItaH zmazAnavastrai rbaddhahastapAdo gAtramArjanavAsasA baddhamukhazca bahirAgacchat| yIzuruditavAn bandhanAni mocayitvA tyajatainaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>mariyamaH samIpam AgatA ye yihUdIyalokAstadA yIzoretat karmmApazyan teSAM bahavo vyazvasan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>kintu kecidanye phirUzinAM samIpaM gatvA yIzoretasya karmmaNo vArttAm avadan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tataH paraM pradhAnayAjakAH phirUzinAzca sabhAM kRtvA vyAharan vayaM kiM kurmmaH? eSa mAnavo bahUnyAzcaryyakarmmANi karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>yadIdRzaM karmma karttuM na vArayAmastarhi sarvve lokAstasmin vizvasiSyanti romilokAzcAgatyAsmAkam anayA rAjadhAnyA sArddhaM rAjyam Achetsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tadA teSAM kiyaphAnAmA yastasmin vatsare mahAyAjakapade nyayujyata sa pratyavadad yUyaM kimapi na jAnItha;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>samagradezasya vinAzatopi sarvvalokArtham ekasya janasya maraNam asmAkaM maGgalahetukam etasya vivecanAmapi na kurutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>etAM kathAM sa nijabuddhyA vyAharad iti na,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>kintu yIzUstaddezIyAnAM kAraNAt prANAn tyakSyati, dizi dizi vikIrNAn Izvarasya santAnAn saMgRhyaikajAtiM kariSyati ca, tasmin vatsare kiyaphA mahAyAjakatvapade niyuktaH san idaM bhaviSyadvAkyaM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>taddinamArabhya te kathaM taM hantuM zaknuvantIti mantraNAM karttuM prArebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>ataeva yihUdIyAnAM madhye yIzuH saprakAzaM gamanAgamane akRtvA tasmAd gatvA prAntarasya samIpasthAyipradezasyephrAyim nAmni nagare ziSyaiH sAkaM kAlaM yApayituM prArebhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>anantaraM yihUdIyAnAM nistArotsave nikaTavarttini sati tadutsavAt pUrvvaM svAn zucIn karttuM bahavo janA grAmebhyo yirUzAlam nagaram Agacchan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yIzoranveSaNaM kRtvA mandire daNDAyamAnAH santaH parasparaM vyAharan, yuSmAkaM kIdRzo bodho jAyate? sa kim utsave'smin atrAgamiSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>sa ca kutrAsti yadyetat kazcid vetti tarhi darzayatu pradhAnayAjakAH phirUzinazca taM dharttuM pUrvvam imAm AjJAM prAcArayan|</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nistArotsavAt pUrvvaM dinaSaTke sthite yIzu ryaM pramItam iliyAsaraM zmazAnAd udasthAparat tasya nivAsasthAnaM baithaniyAgrAmam Agacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tatra tadarthaM rajanyAM bhojye kRte marthA paryyaveSayad iliyAsar ca tasya saGgibhiH sArddhaM bhojanAsana upAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA mariyam arddhaseTakaM bahumUlyaM jaTAmAMsIyaM tailam AnIya yIzozcaraNayo rmarddayitvA nijakeza rmArSTum Arabhata; tadA tailasya parimalena gRham Amoditam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yaH zimonaH putra riSkariyotIyo yihUdAnAmA yIzuM parakareSu samarpayiSyati sa ziSyastadA kathitavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>etattailaM tribhiH zatai rmudrApadai rvikrItaM sad daridrebhyaH kuto nAdIyata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>sa daridralokArtham acintayad iti na, kintu sa caura evaM tannikaTe mudrAsampuTakasthityA tanmadhye yadatiSThat tadapAharat tasmAt kAraNAd imAM kathAmakathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadA yIzurakathayad enAM mA vAraya sA mama zmazAnasthApanadinArthaM tadarakSayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>daridrA yuSmAkaM sannidhau sarvvadA tiSThanti kintvahaM sarvvadA yuSmAkaM sannidhau na tiSThAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzustatrAstIti vArttAM zrutvA bahavo yihUdIyAstaM zmazAnAdutthApitam iliyAsaraJca draSTuM tat sthAnam Agacchana|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadA pradhAnayAjakAstam iliyAsaramapi saMharttum amantrayan ;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yatastena bahavo yihUdIyA gatvA yIzau vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzu ryirUzAlam nagaram AgacchatIti vArttAM zrutvA pare'hani utsavAgatA bahavo lokAH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kharjjUrapatrAdyAnIya taM sAkSAt karttuM bahirAgatya jaya jayeti vAcaM proccai rvaktum Arabhanta, isrAyelo yo rAjA paramezvarasya nAmnAgacchati sa dhanyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA "he siyonaH kanye mA bhaiSIH pazyAyaM tava rAjA garddabhazAvakam AruhyAgacchati"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>iti zAstrIyavacanAnusAreNa yIzurekaM yuvagarddabhaM prApya taduparyyArohat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>asyAH ghaTanAyAstAtparyyaM ziSyAH prathamaM nAbudhyanta, kintu yIzau mahimAnaM prApte sati vAkyamidaM tasmina akathyata lokAzca tampratIttham akurvvan iti te smRtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>sa iliyAsaraM zmazAnAd Agantum AhvatavAn zmazAnAJca udasthApayad ye ye lokAstatkarmya sAkSAd apazyan te pramANaM dAtum Arabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sa etAdRzam adbhutaM karmmakarot tasya janazrute rlokAstaM sAkSAt karttum Agacchan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataH phirUzinaH parasparaM vaktum Arabhanta yuSmAkaM sarvvAzceSTA vRthA jAtAH, iti kiM yUyaM na budhyadhve? pazyata sarvve lokAstasya pazcAdvarttinobhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>bhajanaM karttum utsavAgatAnAM lokAnAM katipayA janA anyadezIyA Asan ,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>te gAlIlIyabaitsaidAnivAsinaH philipasya samIpam Agatya vyAharan he maheccha vayaM yIzuM draSTum icchAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH philipo gatvA Andriyam avadat pazcAd Andriyaphilipau yIzave vArttAm akathayatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyuditavAn mAnavasutasya mahimaprAptisamaya upasthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, dhAnyabIjaM mRttikAyAM patitvA yadi na mRyate tarhyekAkI tiSThati kintu yadi mRyate tarhi bahuguNaM phalaM phalati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yo janeा nijaprANAn priyAn jAnAti sa tAn hArayiSyati kintu yeा jana ihaloke nijaprANAn apriyAn jAnAti seाnantAyuH prAptuM tAn rakSiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kazcid yadi mama sevako bhavituM vAJchati tarhi sa mama pazcAdgAmI bhavatu, tasmAd ahaM yatra tiSThAmi mama sevakeाpi tatra sthAsyati; yo jano mAM sevate mama pitApi taM sammaMsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sAmprataM mama prANA vyAkulA bhavanti, tasmAd he pitara etasmAt samayAn mAM rakSa, ityahaM kiM prArthayiSye? kintvaham etatsamayArtham avatIrNavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>he pita: svanAmno mahimAnaM prakAzaya; tanaiva svanAmno mahimAnam ahaM prAkAzayaM punarapi prakAzayiSyAmi, eSA gagaNIyA vANI tasmin samaye'jAyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>taczrutvA samIpasthalokAnAM kecid avadan megho'garjIt, kecid avadan svargIyadUto'nena saha kathAmacakathat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyavAdIt, madarthaM zabdoyaM nAbhUt yuSmadarthamevAbhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>adhunA jagatosya vicAra: sampatsyate, adhunAsya jagata: patI rAjyAt cyoSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yadyaI pRthivyA Urdvve protthApitosmi tarhi sarvvAn mAnavAn svasamIpam AkarSiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kathaM tasya mRti rbhaviSyati, etad bodhayituM sa imAM kathAm akathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA lokA akathayan sobhiSiktaH sarvvadA tiSThatIti vyavasthAgranthe zrutam asmAbhiH, tarhi manuSyaputraH protthApito bhaviSyatIti vAkyaM kathaM vadasi? manuSyaputroyaM kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadA yIzurakathAyad yuSmAbhiH sArddham alpadinAni jyotirAste, yathA yuSmAn andhakAro nAcchAdayati tadarthaM yAvatkAlaM yuSmAbhiH sArddhaM jyotistiSThati tAvatkAlaM gacchata; yo jano'ndhakAre gacchati sa kutra yAtIti na jAnAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataeva yAvatkAlaM yuSmAkaM nikaTe jyotirAste tAvatkAlaM jyotIrUpasantAnA bhavituM jyotiSi vizvasita; imAM kathAM kathayitvA yIzuH prasthAya tebhyaH svaM guptavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yadyapi yIzusteSAM samakSam etAvadAzcaryyakarmmANi kRtavAn tathApi te tasmin na vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>ataeva kaH pratyeti susaMvAdaM parezAsmat pracAritaM? prakAzate parezasya hastaH kasya ca sannidhau? yizayiyabhaviSyadvAdinA yadetad vAkyamuktaM tat saphalam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>te pratyetuM nAzankuvan tasmin yizayiyabhaviSyadvAdi punaravAdId,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yadA, "te nayanai rna pazyanti buddhibhizca na budhyante tai rmanaHsu parivarttiteSu ca tAnahaM yathA svasthAn na karomi tathA sa teSAM locanAnyandhAni kRtvA teSAmantaHkaraNAni gADhAni kariSyati|"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>yizayiyo yadA yIzo rmahimAnaM vilokya tasmin kathAmakathayat tadA bhaviSyadvAkyam IdRzaM prakAzayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tathApyadhipatinAM bahavastasmin pratyAyan| kintu phirUzinastAn bhajanagRhAd dUrIkurvvantIti bhayAt te taM na svIkRtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>yata Izvarasya prazaMsAto mAnavAnAM prazaMsAyAM te'priyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tadA yIzuruccaiHkAram akathayad yo jano mayi vizvasiti sa kevale mayi vizvasitIti na, sa matprerake'pi vizvasiti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>yo jano mAM pazyati sa matprerakamapi pazyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>yo jano mAM pratyeti sa yathAndhakAre na tiSThati tadartham ahaM jyotiHsvarUpo bhUtvA jagatyasmin avatIrNavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>mama kathAM zrutvA yadi kazcin na vizvasiti tarhi tamahaM doSiNaM na karomi, yato heto rjagato janAnAM doSAn nizcitAn karttuM nAgatya tAn paricAtum Agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>yaH kazcin mAM na zraddhAya mama kathaM na gRhlAti, anyastaM doSiNaM kariSyati vastutastu yAM kathAmaham acakathaM sA kathA carame'nhi taM doSiNaM kariSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>yato hetorahaM svataH kimapi na kathayAmi, kiM kiM mayA kathayitavyaM kiM samupadeSTavyaJca iti matprerayitA pitA mAmAjJApayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tasya sAjJA anantAyurityahaM jAnAmi, ataevAhaM yat kathayAmi tat pitA yathAjJApayat tathaiva kathayAmyaham|</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nistArotsavasya kiJcitkAlAt pUrvvaM pRthivyAH pituH samIpagamanasya samayaH sannikarSobhUd iti jJAtvA yIzurAprathamAd yeSu jagatpravAsiSvAtmIyalokeSa prema karoti sma teSu zeSaM yAvat prema kRtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pitA tasya haste sarvvaM samarpitavAn svayam Izvarasya samIpAd Agacchad Izvarasya samIpaM yAsyati ca, sarvvANyetAni jJAtvA rajanyAM bhojane sampUrNe sati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yadA zaitAn taM parahasteSu samarpayituM zimonaH putrasya ISkAriyotiyasya yihUdA antaHkaraNe kupravRttiM samArpayat,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA yIzu rbhojanAsanAd utthAya gAtravastraM mocayitvA gAtramArjanavastraM gRhItvA tena svakaTim abadhnAt,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>pazcAd ekapAtre jalam abhiSicya ziSyANAM pAdAn prakSAlya tena kaTibaddhagAtramArjanavAsasA mArSTuM prArabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tataH zimonpitarasya samIpamAgate sa uktavAn he prabho bhavAn kiM mama pAdau prakSAlayiSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yIzuruditavAn ahaM yat karomi tat samprati na jAnAsi kintu pazcAj jJAsyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH pitaraH kathitavAn bhavAn kadApi mama pAdau na prakSAlayiSyati| yIzurakathayad yadi tvAM na prakSAlaye tarhi mayi tava kopyaMzo nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA zimonpitaraH kathitavAn he prabho tarhi kevalapAdau na, mama hastau zirazca prakSAlayatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIzuravadad yo jano dhautastasya sarvvAGgapariSkRtatvAt pAdau vinAnyAGgasya prakSAlanApekSA nAsti| yUyaM pariSkRtA iti satyaM kintu na sarvve,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yato yo janastaM parakareSu samarpayiSyati taM sa jJAtavAna; ataeva yUyaM sarvve na pariSkRtA imAM kathAM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>itthaM yIzusteSAM pAdAn prakSAlya vastraM paridhAyAsane samupavizya kathitavAn ahaM yuSmAn prati kiM karmmAkArSaM jAnItha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yUyaM mAM guruM prabhuJca vadatha tat satyameva vadatha yatohaM saeva bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yadyahaM prabhu rguruzca san yuSmAkaM pAdAn prakSAlitavAn tarhi yuSmAkamapi parasparaM pAdaprakSAlanam ucitam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAn prati yathA vyavAharaM yuSmAn tathA vyavaharttum ekaM panthAnaM darzitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, prabho rdAso na mahAn prerakAcca prerito na mahAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>imAM kathAM viditvA yadi tadanusArataH karmmANi kurutha tarhi yUyaM dhanyA bhaviSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sarvveSu yuSmAsu kathAmimAM kathayAmi iti na, ye mama manonItAstAnahaM jAnAmi, kintu mama bhakSyANi yo bhuGkte matprANaprAtikUlyataH| utthApayati pAdasya mUlaM sa eSa mAnavaH|yadetad dharmmapustakasya vacanaM tadanusAreNAvazyaM ghaTiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>ahaM sa jana ityatra yathA yuSmAkaM vizvAso jAyate tadarthaM etAdRzaghaTanAt pUrvvam ahamidAnIM yuSmabhyamakathayam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatIva yathArthaM vadAmi, mayA preritaM janaM yo gRhlAti sa mAmeva gRhlAti yazca mAM gRhlAti sa matprerakaM gRhlAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>etAM kathAM kathayitvA yIzu rduHkhI san pramANaM dattvA kathitavAn ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi yuSmAkam eko jano mAM parakareSu samarpayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH sa kamuddizya kathAmetAM kathitavAn ityatra sandigdhAH ziSyAH parasparaM mukhamAlokayituM prArabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmin samaye yIzu ryasmin aprIyata sa ziSyastasya vakSaHsthalam avAlambata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>zimonpitarastaM saGketenAvadat, ayaM kamuddizya kathAmetAm kathayatIti pRccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sa yIzo rvakSaHsthalam avalambya pRSThavAn, he prabho sa janaH kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyavadad ekakhaNDaM pUpaM majjayitvA yasmai dAsyAmi saeva saH; pazcAt pUpakhaNDamekaM majjayitvA zimonaH putrAya ISkariyotIyAya yihUdai dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tasmin datte sati zaitAn tamAzrayat; tadA yIzustam avadat tvaM yat kariSyasi tat kSipraM kuru|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>kintu sa yenAzayena tAM kathAmakathAyat tam upaviSTalokAnAM kopi nAbudhyata;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kintu yihUdAH samIpe mudrAsampuTakasthiteH kecid ittham abudhyanta pArvvaNAsAdanArthaM kimapi dravyaM kretuM vA daridrebhyaH kiJcid vitarituM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA pUpakhaNDagrahaNAt paraM sa tUrNaM bahiragacchat; rAtrizca samupasyitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>yihUde bahirgate yIzurakathayad idAnIM mAnavasutasya mahimA prakAzate tenezvarasyApi mahimA prakAzate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yadi tenezvarasya mahimA prakAzate tarhIzvaropi svena tasya mahimAnaM prakAzayiSyati tUrNameva prakAzayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>he vatsA ahaM yuSmAbhiH sArddhaM kiJcitkAlamAtram Ase, tataH paraM mAM mRgayiSyadhve kintvahaM yatsthAnaM yAmi tatsthAnaM yUyaM gantuM na zakSyatha, yAmimAM kathAM yihUdIyebhyaH kathitavAn tathAdhunA yuSmabhyamapi kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yUyaM parasparaM prIyadhvam ahaM yuSmAsu yathA prIye yUyamapi parasparam tathaiva prIyadhvaM, yuSmAn imAM navInAm AjJAm AdizAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tenaiva yadi parasparaM prIyadhve tarhi lakSaNenAnena yUyaM mama ziSyA iti sarvve jJAtuM zakSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>zimonapitaraH pRSThavAn he prabho bhavAn kutra yAsyati? tato yIzuH pratyavadat, ahaM yatsthAnaM yAmi tatsthAnaM sAmprataM mama pazcAd gantuM na zaknoSi kintu pazcAd gamiSyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA pitaraH pratyuditavAn, he prabho sAmprataM kuto hetostava pazcAd gantuM na zaknomi? tvadarthaM prANAn dAtuM zaknomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyuktavAn mannimittaM kiM prANAn dAtuM zaknoSi? tvAmahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, kukkuTaravaNAt pUrvvaM tvaM tri rmAm apahnoSyase|</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>manoduHkhino mA bhUta; Izvare vizvasita mayi ca vizvasita|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>mama pitu gRhe bahUni vAsasthAni santi no cet pUrvvaM yuSmAn ajJApayiSyaM yuSmadarthaM sthAnaM sajjayituM gacchAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yadi gatvAhaM yuSmannimittaM sthAnaM sajjayAmi tarhi panarAgatya yuSmAn svasamIpaM neSyAmi, tato yatrAhaM tiSThAmi tatra yUyamapi sthAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ahaM yatsthAnaM brajAmi tatsthAnaM yUyaM jAnItha tasya panthAnamapi jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA thomA avadat, he prabho bhavAn kutra yAti tadvayaM na jAnImaH, tarhi kathaM panthAnaM jJAtuM zaknumaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIzurakathayad ahameva satyajIvanarUpapatho mayA na gantA kopi pituH samIpaM gantuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yadi mAm ajJAsyata tarhi mama pitaramapyajJAsyata kintvadhunAtastaM jAnItha pazyatha ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA philipaH kathitavAn, he prabho pitaraM darzaya tasmAdasmAkaM yatheSTaM bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyAvAdIt, he philipa yuSmAbhiH sArddham etAvaddinAni sthitamapi mAM kiM na pratyabhijAnAsi? yo jano mAm apazyat sa pitaramapyapazyat tarhi pitaram asmAn darzayeti kathAM kathaM kathayasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ahaM pitari tiSThAmi pitA mayi tiSThatIti kiM tvaM na pratyaSi? ahaM yadvAkyaM vadAmi tat svato na vadAmi kintu yaH pitA mayi virAjate sa eva sarvvakarmmANi karAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ataeva pitaryyahaM tiSThAmi pitA ca mayi tiSThati mamAsyAM kathAyAM pratyayaM kuruta, no cet karmmahetoH pratyayaM kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, yo jano mayi vizvasiti sohamiva karmmANi kariSyati varaM tatopi mahAkarmmANi kariSyati yato hetorahaM pituH samIpaM gacchAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yathA putreNa pitu rmahimA prakAzate tadarthaM mama nAma procya yat prArthayiSyadhve tat saphalaM kariSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yadi mama nAmnA yat kiJcid yAcadhve tarhi tadahaM sAdhayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yadi mayi prIyadhve tarhi mamAjJAH samAcarata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato mayA pituH samIpe prArthite pitA nirantaraM yuSmAbhiH sArddhaM sthAtum itaramekaM sahAyam arthAt satyamayam AtmAnaM yuSmAkaM nikaTaM preSayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>etajjagato lokAstaM grahItuM na zaknuvanti yataste taM nApazyan nAjanaMzca kintu yUyaM jAnItha yato hetoH sa yuSmAkamanta rnivasati yuSmAkaM madhye sthAsyati ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAn anAthAn kRtvA na yAsyAmi punarapi yuSmAkaM samIpam AgamiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>kiyatkAlarat param asya jagato lokA mAM puna rna drakSyanti kintu yUyaM drakSyatha;ahaM jIviSyAmi tasmAt kAraNAd yUyamapi jIviSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>pitaryyahamasmi mayi ca yUyaM stha, tathAhaM yuSmAsvasmi tadapi tadA jJAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yo jano mamAjJA gRhItvA tA Acarati saeva mayi prIyate; yo janazca mayi prIyate saeva mama pituH priyapAtraM bhaviSyati, tathAhamapi tasmin prItvA tasmai svaM prakAzayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA ISkariyotIyAd anyo yihUdAstamavadat, he prabho bhavAn jagato lokAnAM sannidhau prakAzito na bhUtvAsmAkaM sannidhau kutaH prakAzito bhaviSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyuditavAn, yo jano mayi prIyate sa mamAjJA api gRhlAti, tena mama pitApi tasmin preSyate, AvAJca tannikaTamAgatya tena saha nivatsyAvaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yo jano mayi na prIyate sa mama kathA api na gRhlAti punazca yAmimAM kathAM yUyaM zRNutha sA kathA kevalasya mama na kintu mama prerako yaH pitA tasyApi kathA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>idAnIM yuSmAkaM nikaTe vidyamAnoham etAH sakalAH kathAH kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintvitaH paraM pitrA yaH sahAyo'rthAt pavitra AtmA mama nAmni prerayiSyati sa sarvvaM zikSayitvA mayoktAH samastAH kathA yuSmAn smArayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAkaM nikaTe zAntiM sthApayitvA yAmi, nijAM zAntiM yuSmabhyaM dadAmi, jagato lokA yathA dadAti tathAhaM na dadAmi; yuSmAkam antaHkaraNAni duHkhitAni bhItAni ca na bhavantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM gatvA punarapi yuSmAkaM samIpam AgamiSyAmi mayoktaM vAkyamidaM yUyam azrauSTa; yadi mayyapreSyadhvaM tarhyahaM pituH samIpaM gacchAmi mamAsyAM kathAyAM yUyam ahlAdiSyadhvaM yato mama pitA mattopi mahAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tasyA ghaTanAyAH samaye yathA yuSmAkaM zraddhA jAyate tadartham ahaM tasyA ghaTanAyAH pUrvvam idAnIM yuSmAn etAM vArttAM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>itaH paraM yuSmAbhiH saha mama bahava AlApA na bhaviSyanti yataH kAraNAd etasya jagataH patirAgacchati kintu mayA saha tasya kopi sambandho nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ahaM pitari prema karomi tathA pitu rvidhivat karmmANi karomIti yena jagato lokA jAnanti tadartham uttiSThata vayaM sthAnAdasmAd gacchAma|</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>ahaM satyadrAkSAlatAsvarUpo mama pitA tUdyAnaparicArakasvarUpaJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>mama yAsu zAkhAsu phalAni na bhavanti tAH sa chinatti tathA phalavatyaH zAkhA yathAdhikaphalAni phalanti tadarthaM tAH pariSkaroti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>idAnIM mayoktopadezena yUyaM pariSkRtAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ataH kAraNAt mayi tiSThata tenAhamapi yuSmAsu tiSThAmi, yato heto rdrAkSAlatAyAm asaMlagnA zAkhA yathA phalavatI bhavituM na zaknoti tathA yUyamapi mayyatiSThantaH phalavanto bhavituM na zaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ahaM drAkSAlatAsvarUpo yUyaJca zAkhAsvarUpoH; yo jano mayi tiSThati yatra cAhaM tiSThAmi, sa pracUraphalaiH phalavAn bhavati, kintu mAM vinA yUyaM kimapi karttuM na zaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yaH kazcin mayi na tiSThati sa zuSkazAkheva bahi rnikSipyate lokAzca tA AhRtya vahnau nikSipya dAhayanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM mayi tiSThatha mama kathA ca yuSmAsu tiSThati tarhi yad vAJchitvA yAciSyadhve yuSmAkaM tadeva saphalaM bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM pracUraphalavanto bhavatha tarhi tadvArA mama pitu rmahimA prakAziSyate tathA yUyaM mama ziSyA iti parikSAyiSyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>pitA yathA mayi prItavAn ahamapi yuSmAsu tathA prItavAn ato heto ryUyaM nirantaraM mama premapAtrANi bhUtvA tiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ahaM yathA piturAjJA gRhItvA tasya premabhAjanaM tiSThAmi tathaiva yUyamapi yadi mamAjJA guhlItha tarhi mama premabhAjanAni sthAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yuSmannimittaM mama ya AhlAdaH sa yathA ciraM tiSThati yuSmAkam Anandazca yathA pUryyate tadarthaM yuSmabhyam etAH kathA atrakatham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAsu yathA prIye yUyamapi parasparaM tathA prIyadhvam eSA mamAjJA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>mitrANAM kAraNAt svaprANadAnaparyyantaM yat prema tasmAn mahAprema kasyApi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ahaM yadyad AdizAmi tattadeva yadi yUyam Acarata tarhi yUyameva mama mitrANi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>adyArabhya yuSmAn dAsAn na vadiSyAmi yat prabhu ryat karoti dAsastad na jAnAti; kintu pituH samIpe yadyad azRNavaM tat sarvvaM yUSmAn ajJApayam tatkAraNAd yuSmAn mitrANi proktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>yUyaM mAM rocitavanta iti na, kintvahameva yuSmAn rocitavAn yUyaM gatvA yathA phalAnyutpAdayatha tAni phalAni cAkSayANi bhavanti, tadarthaM yuSmAn nyajunajaM tasmAn mama nAma procya pitaraM yat kiJcid yAciSyadhve tadeva sa yuSmabhyaM dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yUyaM parasparaM prIyadhvam aham ityAjJApayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>jagato lokai ryuSmAsu RtIyiteSu te pUrvvaM mAmevArttIyanta iti yUyaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM jagato lokA abhaviSyata tarhi jagato lokA yuSmAn AtmIyAn buddhvApreSyanta; kintu yUyaM jagato lokA na bhavatha, ahaM yuSmAn asmAjjagato'rocayam etasmAt kAraNAjjagato lokA yuSmAn RtIyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>dAsaH prabho rmahAn na bhavati mamaitat pUrvvIyaM vAkyaM smarata; te yadi mAmevAtADayan tarhi yuSmAnapi tADayiSyanti, yadi mama vAkyaM gRhlanti tarhi yuSmAkamapi vAkyaM grahISyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu te mama nAmakAraNAd yuSmAn prati tAdRzaM vyavahariSyanti yato yo mAM preritavAn taM te na jAnanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>teSAM sannidhim Agatya yadyahaM nAkathayiSyaM tarhi teSAM pApaM nAbhaviSyat kintvadhunA teSAM pApamAcchAdayitum upAyo nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yo jano mAm RtIyate sa mama pitaramapi RtIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yAdRzAni karmmANi kenApi kadApi nAkriyanta tAdRzAni karmmANi yadi teSAM sAkSAd ahaM nAkariSyaM tarhi teSAM pApaM nAbhaviSyat kintvadhunA te dRSTvApi mAM mama pitaraJcArttIyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tasmAt te'kAraNaM mAm RtIyante yadetad vacanaM teSAM zAstre likhitamAste tat saphalam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintu pitu rnirgataM yaM sahAyamarthAt satyamayam AtmAnaM pituH samIpAd yuSmAkaM samIpe preSayiSyAmi sa Agatya mayi pramANaM dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>yUyaM prathamamArabhya mayA sArddhaM tiSThatha tasmAddheto ryUyamapi pramANaM dAsyatha|</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>yuSmAkaM yathA vAdhA na jAyate tadarthaM yuSmAn etAni sarvvavAkyAni vyAharaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>lokA yuSmAn bhajanagRhebhyo dUrIkariSyanti tathA yasmin samaye yuSmAn hatvA Izvarasya tuSTi janakaM karmmAkurmma iti maMsyante sa samaya Agacchanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>te pitaraM mAJca na jAnanti, tasmAd yuSmAn pratIdRzam AcariSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ato hetAH samaye samupasthite yathA mama kathA yuSmAkaM manaHsuH samupatiSThati tadarthaM yuSmAbhyam etAM kathAM kathayAmi yuSmAbhiH sArddham ahaM tiSThan prathamaM tAM yuSmabhyaM nAkathayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>sAmprataM svasya prerayituH samIpaM gacchAmi tathApi tvaM kka gacchasi kathAmetAM yuSmAkaM kopi mAM na pRcchati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintu mayoktAbhirAbhiH kathAbhi ryUSmAkam antaHkaraNAni duHkhena pUrNAnyabhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tathApyahaM yathArthaM kathayAmi mama gamanaM yuSmAkaM hitArthameva, yato heto rgamane na kRte sahAyo yuSmAkaM samIpaM nAgamiSyati kintu yadi gacchAmi tarhi yuSmAkaM samIpe taM preSayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH sa Agatya pApapuNyadaNDeSu jagato lokAnAM prabodhaM janayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>te mayi na vizvasanti tasmAddhetoH pApaprabodhaM janayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yuSmAkam adRzyaH sannahaM pituH samIpaM gacchAmi tasmAd puNye prabodhaM janayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>etajjagato'dhipati rdaNDAjJAM prApnoti tasmAd daNDe prabodhaM janayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yuSmabhyaM kathayituM mamAnekAH kathA Asate, tAH kathA idAnIM yUyaM soDhuM na zaknutha;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu satyamaya AtmA yadA samAgamiSyati tadA sarvvaM satyaM yuSmAn neSyati, sa svataH kimapi na vadiSyati kintu yacchroSyati tadeva kathayitvA bhAvikAryyaM yuSmAn jJApayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>mama mahimAnaM prakAzayiSyati yato madIyAM kathAM gRhItvA yuSmAn bodhayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>pitu ryadyad Aste tat sarvvaM mama tasmAd kAraNAd avAdiSaM sa madIyAM kathAM gRhItvA yuSmAn bodhayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kiyatkAlAt paraM yUyaM mAM draSTuM na lapsyadhve kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM puna rdraSTuM lapsyadhve yatohaM pituH samIpaM gacchAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataH ziSyANAM kiyanto janAH parasparaM vaditum Arabhanta, kiyatkAlAt paraM mAM draSTuM na lapsyadhve kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM puna rdraSTuM lapsyadhve yatohaM pituH samIpaM gacchAmi, iti yad vAkyam ayaM vadati tat kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH kiyatkAlAt param iti tasya vAkyaM kiM? tasya vAkyasyAbhiprAyaM vayaM boddhuM na zaknumastairiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>nigadite yIzusteSAM praznecchAM jJAtvA tebhyo'kathayat kiyatkAlAt paraM mAM draSTuM na lapsyadhve, kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM pUna rdraSTuM lapsyadhve, yAmimAM kathAmakathayaM tasyA abhiprAyaM kiM yUyaM parasparaM mRgayadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yuSmAnaham atiyathArthaM vadAmi yUyaM krandiSyatha vilapiSyatha ca, kintu jagato lokA AnandiSyanti; yUyaM zokAkulA bhaviSyatha kintu zokAt paraM AnandayuktA bhaviSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>prasavakAla upasthite nArI yathA prasavavedanayA vyAkulA bhavati kintu putre bhUmiSThe sati manuSyaiko janmanA naraloke praviSTa ityAnandAt tasyAstatsarvvaM duHkhaM manasi na tiSThati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tathA yUyamapi sAmprataM zokAkulA bhavatha kintu punarapi yuSmabhyaM darzanaM dAsyAmi tena yuSmAkam antaHkaraNAni sAnandAni bhaviSyanti, yuSmAkaM tam AnandaJca kopi harttuM na zakSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmin divase kAmapi kathAM mAM na prakSyatha| yuSmAnaham atiyathArthaM vadAmi, mama nAmnA yat kiJcid pitaraM yAciSyadhve tadeva sa dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>pUrvve mama nAmnA kimapi nAyAcadhvaM, yAcadhvaM tataH prApsyatha tasmAd yuSmAkaM sampUrNAnando janiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>upamAkathAbhiH sarvvANyetAni yuSmAn jJApitavAn kintu yasmin samaye upamayA noktvA pituH kathAM spaSTaM jJApayiSyAmi samaya etAdRza Agacchati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA mama nAmnA prArthayiSyadhve 'haM yuSmannimittaM pitaraM vineSye kathAmimAM na vadAmi;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>yato yUyaM mayi prema kurutha, tathAham Izvarasya samIpAd AgatavAn ityapi pratItha, tasmAd kAraNAt kAraNAt pitA svayaM yuSmAsu prIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>pituH samIpAjjajad Agatosmi jagat parityajya ca punarapi pituH samIpaM gacchAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tadA ziSyA avadan, he prabho bhavAn upamayA noktvAdhunA spaSTaM vadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>bhavAn sarvvajJaH kenacit pRSTo bhavitumapi bhavataH prayojanaM nAstItyadhunAsmAkaM sthirajJAnaM jAtaM tasmAd bhavAn Izvarasya samIpAd AgatavAn ityatra vayaM vizvasimaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyavAdId idAnIM kiM yUyaM vizvasitha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>pazyata sarvve yUyaM vikIrNAH santo mAm ekAkinaM pIratyajya svaM svaM sthAnaM gamiSyatha, etAdRzaH samaya Agacchati varaM prAyeNopasthitavAn; tathApyahaM naikAkI bhavAmi yataH pitA mayA sArddham Aste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yathA mayA yuSmAkaM zAnti rjAyate tadartham etAH kathA yuSmabhyam acakathaM; asmin jagati yuSmAkaM klezo ghaTiSyate kintvakSobhA bhavata yato mayA jagajjitaM|</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzuretAH kathAH kathayitvA svargaM vilokyaitat prArthayat, he pitaH samaya upasthitavAn; yathA tava putrastava mahimAnaM prakAzayati tadarthaM tvaM nijaputrasya mahimAnaM prakAzaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tvaM yollokAn tasya haste samarpitavAn sa yathA tebhyo'nantAyu rdadAti tadarthaM tvaM prANimAtrANAm adhipatitvabhAraM tasmai dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yastvam advitIyaH satya IzvarastvayA preritazca yIzuH khrISTa etayorubhayoH paricaye prApte'nantAyu rbhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tvaM yasya karmmaNo bhAraM mahyaM dattavAn, tat sampannaM kRtvA jagatyasmin tava mahimAnaM prAkAzayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ataeva he pita rjagatyavidyamAne tvayA saha tiSThato mama yo mahimAsIt samprati tava samIpe mAM taM mahimAnaM prApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>anyacca tvam etajjagato yAllokAn mahyam adadA ahaM tebhyastava nAmnastattvajJAnam adadAM, te tavaivAsan, tvaM tAn mahyamadadAH, tasmAtte tavopadezam agRhlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tvaM mahyaM yat kiJcid adadAstatsarvvaM tvatto jAyate ityadhunAjAnan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>mahyaM yamupadezam adadA ahamapi tebhyastamupadezam adadAM tepi tamagRhlan tvattohaM nirgatya tvayA preritobhavam atra ca vyazvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>teSAmeva nimittaM prArthaye'haM jagato lokanimittaM na prArthaye kintu yAllokAn mahyam adadAsteSAmeva nimittaM prArthaye'haM yataste tavaivAsate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ye mama te tava ye ca tava te mama tathA tai rmama mahimA prakAzyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>sAmpratam asmin jagati mamAvasthiteH zeSam abhavat ahaM tava samIpaM gacchAmi kintu te jagati sthAsyanti; he pavitra pitarAvayo ryathaikatvamAste tathA teSAmapyekatvaM bhavati tadarthaM yAllokAn mahyam adadAstAn svanAmnA rakSa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yAvanti dinAni jagatyasmin taiH sahAhamAsaM tAvanti dinAni tAn tava nAmnAhaM rakSitavAn; yAllokAn mahyam adadAstAn sarvvAn ahamarakSaM, teSAM madhye kevalaM vinAzapAtraM hAritaM tena dharmmapustakasya vacanaM pratyakSaM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintvadhunA tava sannidhiM gacchAmi mayA yathA teSAM sampUrNAnando bhavati tadarthamahaM jagati tiSThan etAH kathA akathayam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tavopadezaM tebhyo'dadAM jagatA saha yathA mama sambandho nAsti tathA jajatA saha teSAmapi sambandhAbhAvAj jagato lokAstAn RtIyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tvaM jagatastAn gRhANeti na prArthaye kintvazubhAd rakSeti prArthayeham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ahaM yathA jagatsambandhIyo na bhavAmi tathA tepi jagatsambandhIyA na bhavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tava satyakathayA tAn pavitrIkuru tava vAkyameva satyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tvaM yathA mAM jagati prairayastathAhamapi tAn jagati prairayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>teSAM hitArthaM yathAhaM svaM pavitrIkaromi tathA satyakathayA tepi pavitrIbhavantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>kevalaM eteSAmarthe prArthaye'ham iti na kintveteSAmupadezena ye janA mayi vizvasiSyanti teSAmapyarthe prArtheye'ham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>he pitasteSAM sarvveSAm ekatvaM bhavatu tava yathA mayi mama ca yathA tvayyekatvaM tathA teSAmapyAvayorekatvaM bhavatu tena tvaM mAM preritavAn iti jagato lokAH pratiyantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yathAvayorekatvaM tathA teSAmapyekatvaM bhavatu teSvahaM mayi ca tvam itthaM teSAM sampUrNamekatvaM bhavatu, tvaM preritavAn tvaM mayi yathA prIyase ca tathA teSvapi prItavAn etadyathA jagato lokA jAnanti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadarthaM tvaM yaM mahimAnaM mahyam adadAstaM mahimAnam ahamapi tebhyo dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>he pita rjagato nirmmANAt pUrvvaM mayi snehaM kRtvA yaM mahimAnaM dattavAn mama taM mahimAnaM yathA te pazyanti tadarthaM yAllokAn mahyaM dattavAn ahaM yatra tiSThAmi tepi yathA tatra tiSThanti mamaiSA vAJchA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>he yathArthika pita rjagato lokaistvayyajJAtepi tvAmahaM jAne tvaM mAM preritavAn itIme ziSyA jAnanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yathAhaM teSu tiSThAmi tathA mayi yena premnA premAkarostat teSu tiSThati tadarthaM tava nAmAhaM tAn jJApitavAn punarapi jJApayiSyAmi|</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tAH kathAH kathayitvA yIzuH ziSyAnAdAya kidronnAmakaM srota uttIryya ziSyaiH saha tatratyodyAnaM prAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>kintu vizvAsaghAtiyihUdAstat sthAnaM paricIyate yato yIzuH ziSyaiH sArddhaM kadAcit tat sthAnam agacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA sa yihUdAH sainyagaNaM pradhAnayAjakAnAM phirUzinAJca padAtigaNaJca gRhItvA pradIpAn ulkAn astrANi cAdAya tasmin sthAna upasthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>svaM prati yad ghaTiSyate taj jJAtvA yIzuragresaraH san tAnapRcchat kaM gaveSayatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>te pratyavadan, nAsaratIyaM yIzuM; tato yIzuravAdId ahameva saH; taiH saha vizvAsaghAtI yihUdAzcAtiSThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadAhameva sa tasyaitAM kathAM zrutvaiva te pazcAdetya bhUmau patitAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tato yIzuH punarapi pRSThavAn kaM gaveSayatha? tataste pratyavadan nAsaratIyaM yIzuM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyuditavAn ahameva sa imAM kathAmacakatham; yadi mAmanvicchatha tarhImAn gantuM mA vArayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>itthaM bhUte mahyaM yAllokAn adadAsteSAm ekamapi nAhArayam imAM yAM kathAM sa svayamakathayat sA kathA saphalA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadA zimonpitarasya nikaTe khaGgalsthiteH sa taM niSkoSaM kRtvA mahAyAjakasya mAlkhanAmAnaM dAsam Ahatya tasya dakSiNakarNaM chinnavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pitaram avadat, khaGgaM koSe sthApaya mama pitA mahyaM pAtuM yaM kaMsam adadAt tenAhaM kiM na pAsyAmi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA sainyagaNaH senApati ryihUdIyAnAM padAtayazca yIzuM ghRtvA baddhvA hAnannAmnaH kiyaphAH zvazurasya samIpaM prathamam anayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>sa kiyaphAstasmin vatsare mahAyAjatvapade niyuktaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>san sAdhAraNalokAnAM maGgalArtham ekajanasya maraNamucitam iti yihUdIyaiH sArddham amantrayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA zimonpitaro'nyaikaziSyazca yIzoH pazcAd agacchatAM tasyAnyaziSyasya mahAyAjakena paricitatvAt sa yIzunA saha mahAyAjakasyATTAlikAM prAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kintu pitaro bahirdvArasya samIpe'tiSThad ataeva mahAyAjakena paricitaH sa ziSyaH punarbahirgatvA dauvAyikAyai kathayitvA pitaram abhyantaram Anayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadA sa dvArarakSikA pitaram avadat tvaM kiM na tasya mAnavasya ziSyaH? tataH sovadad ahaM na bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH paraM yatsthAne dAsAH padAtayazca zItahetoraGgArai rvahniM prajvAlya tApaM sevitavantastatsthAne pitarastiSThan taiH saha vahnitApaM sevitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA ziSyeSUpadeze ca mahAyAjakena yIzuH pRSTaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>san pratyuktavAn sarvvalokAnAM samakSaM kathAmakathayaM guptaM kAmapi kathAM na kathayitvA yat sthAnaM yihUdIyAH satataM gacchanti tatra bhajanagehe mandire cAzikSayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>mattaH kutaH pRcchasi? ye janA madupadezam azRNvan tAneva pRccha yadyad avadaM te tat jAninta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadetthaM pratyuditatvAt nikaTasthapadAti ryIzuM capeTenAhatya vyAharat mahAyAjakam evaM prativadasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratigaditavAn yadyayathArtham acakathaM tarhi tasyAyathArthasya pramANaM dehi, kintu yadi yathArthaM tarhi kuto heto rmAm atADayaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>pUrvvaM hAnan sabandhanaM taM kiyaphAmahAyAjakasya samIpaM praiSayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>zimonpitarastiSThan vahnitApaM sevate, etasmin samaye kiyantastam apRcchan tvaM kim etasya janasya ziSyo na? tataH sopahnutyAbravId ahaM na bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA mahAyAjakasya yasya dAsasya pitaraH karNamacchinat tasya kuTumbaH pratyuditavAn udyAne tena saha tiSThantaM tvAM kiM nApazyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu pitaraH punarapahnutya kathitavAn; tadAnIM kukkuTo'raut|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadanantaraM pratyUSe te kiyaphAgRhAd adhipate rgRhaM yIzum anayan kintu yasmin azucitve jAte tai rnistArotsave na bhoktavyaM, tasya bhayAd yihUdIyAstadgRhaM nAvizan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>aparaM pIlAto bahirAgatya tAn pRSThavAn etasya manuSyasya kaM doSaM vadatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA te petyavadan duSkarmmakAriNi na sati bhavataH samIpe nainaM samArpayiSyAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tataH pIlAto'vadad yUyamenaM gRhItvA sveSAM vyavasthayA vicArayata| tadA yihUdIyAH pratyavadan kasyApi manuSyasya prANadaNDaM karttuM nAsmAkam adhikAro'sti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>evaM sati yIzuH svasya mRtyau yAM kathAM kathitavAn sA saphalAbhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadanantaraM pIlAtaH punarapi tad rAjagRhaM gatvA yIzumAhUya pRSTavAn tvaM kiM yihUdIyAnAM rAjA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyavadat tvam etAM kathAM svataH kathayasi kimanyaH kazcin mayi kathitavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pIlAto'vadad ahaM kiM yihUdIyaH? tava svadezIyA vizeSataH pradhAnayAjakA mama nikaTe tvAM samArpayana, tvaM kiM kRtavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yIzuH pratyavadat mama rAjyam etajjagatsambandhIyaM na bhavati yadi mama rAjyaM jagatsambandhIyam abhaviSyat tarhi yihUdIyAnAM hasteSu yathA samarpito nAbhavaM tadarthaM mama sevakA ayotsyan kintu mama rAjyam aihikaM na|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtaH kathitavAn, tarhi tvaM rAjA bhavasi? yIzuH pratyuktavAn tvaM satyaM kathayasi, rAjAhaM bhavAmi; satyatAyAM sAkSyaM dAtuM janiM gRhItvA jagatyasmin avatIrNavAn, tasmAt satyadharmmapakSapAtino mama kathAM zRNvanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA satyaM kiM? etAM kathAM paSTvA pIlAtaH punarapi bahirgatvA yihUdIyAn abhASata, ahaM tasya kamapyaparAdhaM na prApnomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>nistArotsavasamaye yuSmAbhirabhirucita eko jano mayA mocayitavya eSA yuSmAkaM rItirasti, ataeva yuSmAkaM nikaTe yihUdIyAnAM rAjAnaM kiM mocayAmi, yuSmAkam icchA kA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadA te sarvve ruvanto vyAharan enaM mAnuSaM nahi barabbAM mocaya| kintu sa barabbA dasyurAsIt|</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>pIlAto yIzum AnIya kazayA prAhArayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pazcAt senAgaNaH kaNTakanirmmitaM mukuTaM tasya mastake samarpya vArttAkIvarNaM rAjaparicchadaM paridhApya,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>he yihUdIyAnAM rAjan namaskAra ityuktvA taM capeTenAhantum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtaH punarapi bahirgatvA lokAn avadat, asya kamapyaparAdhaM na labhe'haM, pazyata tad yuSmAn jJApayituM yuSmAkaM sannidhau bahirenam AnayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzuH kaNTakamukuTavAn vArttAkIvarNavasanavAMzca bahirAgacchat| tataH pIlAta uktavAn enaM manuSyaM pazyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA pradhAnayAjakAH padAtayazca taM dRSTvA, enaM kruze vidha, enaM kruze vidha, ityuktvA ravituM Arabhanta| tataH pIlAtaH kathitavAn yUyaM svayam enaM nItvA kruze vidhata, aham etasya kamapyaparAdhaM na prAptavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yihUdIyAH pratyavadan asmAkaM yA vyavasthAste tadanusAreNAsya prANahananam ucitaM yatoyaM svam Izvarasya putramavadat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>pIlAta imAM kathAM zrutvA mahAtrAsayuktaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>san punarapi rAjagRha Agatya yIzuM pRSTavAn tvaM kutratyo lokaH? kintu yIzastasya kimapi pratyuttaraM nAvadat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>1# tataH pIlAt kathitavAna tvaM kiM mayA sArddhaM na saMlapiSyasi ? tvAM kruze vedhituM vA mocayituM zakti rmamAste iti kiM tvaM na jAnAsi ? tadA yIzuH pratyavadad IzvareNAdaŸाM mamopari tava kimapyadhipatitvaM na vidyate, tathApi yo jano mAM tava haste samArpayat tasya mahApAtakaM jAtam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyavadad IzvareNAdattaM mamopari tava kimapyadhipatitvaM na vidyate, tathApi yo jano mAM tava haste samArpayat tasya mahApAtakaM jAtam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadArabhya pIlAtastaM mocayituM ceSTitavAn kintu yihUdIyA ruvanto vyAharan yadImaM mAnavaM tyajasi tarhi tvaM kaisarasya mitraM na bhavasi, yo janaH svaM rAjAnaM vakti saeva kaimarasya viruddhAM kathAM kathayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>etAM kathAM zrutvA pIlAto yIzuM bahirAnIya nistArotsavasya AsAdanadinasya dvitIyapraharAt pUrvvaM prastarabandhananAmni sthAne 'rthAt ibrIyabhASayA yad gabbithA kathyate tasmin sthAne vicArAsana upAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>anantaraM pIlAto yihUdIyAn avadat, yuSmAkaM rAjAnaM pazyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu enaM dUrIkuru, enaM dUrIkuru, enaM kruze vidha, iti kathAM kathayitvA te ravitum Arabhanta; tadA pIlAtaH kathitavAn yuSmAkaM rAjAnaM kiM kruze vedhiSyAmi? pradhAnayAjakA uttaram avadan kaisaraM vinA kopi rAjAsmAkaM nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataH pIlAto yIzuM kruze vedhituM teSAM hasteSu samArpayat, tataste taM dhRtvA nItavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIzuH kruzaM vahan ziraHkapAlam arthAd yad ibrIyabhASayA gulgaltAM vadanti tasmin sthAna upasthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataste madhyasthAne taM tasyobhayapArzve dvAvaparau kruze'vidhan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>aparam eSa yihUdIyAnAM rAjA nAsaratIyayIzuH, iti vijJApanaM likhitvA pIlAtastasya kruzopari samayojayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>sA lipiH ibrIyayUnAnIyaromIyabhASAbhi rlikhitA; yIzoH kruzavedhanasthAnaM nagarasya samIpaM, tasmAd bahavo yihUdIyAstAM paThitum Arabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAM pradhAnayAjakAH pIlAtamiti nyavedayan yihUdIyAnAM rAjeti vAkyaM na kintu eSa svaM yihUdIyAnAM rAjAnam avadad itthaM likhatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH pIlAta uttaraM dattavAn yallekhanIyaM tallikhitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>itthaM senAgaNo yIzuM kruze vidhitvA tasya paridheyavastraM caturo bhAgAn kRtvA ekaikasenA ekaikabhAgam agRhlat tasyottarIyavastraJcAgRhlat| kintUttarIyavastraM sUcisevanaM vinA sarvvam UtaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasmAtte vyAharan etat kaH prApsyati? tanna khaNDayitvA tatra guTikApAtaM karavAma| vibhajante'dharIyaM me vasanaM te parasparaM| mamottarIyavastrArthaM guTikAM pAtayanti ca| iti yadvAkyaM dharmmapustake likhitamAste tat senAgaNenetthaM vyavaharaNAt siddhamabhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadAnIM yIzo rmAtA mAtu rbhaginI ca yA kliyapA bhAryyA mariyam magdalInI mariyam ca etAstasya kruzasya sannidhau samatiSThan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIzuH svamAtaraM priyatamaziSyaJca samIpe daNDAyamAnau vilokya mAtaram avadat, he yoSid enaM tava putraM pazya,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>ziSyantvavadat, enAM tava mAtaraM pazya| tataH sa ziSyastadghaTikAyAM tAM nijagRhaM nItavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>anantaraM sarvvaM karmmAdhunA sampannamabhUt yIzuriti jJAtvA dharmmapustakasya vacanaM yathA siddhaM bhavati tadartham akathayat mama pipAsA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tatastasmin sthAne amlarasena pUrNapAtrasthityA te spaJjamekaM tadamlarasenArdrIkRtya esobnale tad yojayitvA tasya mukhasya sannidhAvasthApayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA yIzuramlarasaM gRhItvA sarvvaM siddham iti kathAM kathayitvA mastakaM namayan prANAn paryyatyajat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tadvinam AsAdanadinaM tasmAt pare'hani vizrAmavAre dehA yathA kruzopari na tiSThanti, yataH sa vizrAmavAro mahAdinamAsIt, tasmAd yihUdIyAH pIlAtanikaTaM gatvA teSAM pAdabhaJjanasya sthAnAntaranayanasya cAnumatiM prArthayanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>ataH senA Agatya yIzunA saha kruze hatayoH prathamadvitIyacorayoH pAdAn abhaJjan;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kintu yIzoH sannidhiM gatvA sa mRta iti dRSTvA tasya pAdau nAbhaJjan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>pazcAd eko yoddhA zUlAghAtena tasya kukSim avidhat tatkSaNAt tasmAd raktaM jalaJca niragacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yo jano'sya sAkSyaM dadAti sa svayaM dRSTavAn tasyedaM sAkSyaM satyaM tasya kathA yuSmAkaM vizvAsaM janayituM yogyA tat sa jAnAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tasyaikam asdhyapi na bhaMkSyate,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadvad anyazAstrepi likhyate, yathA, "dRSTipAtaM kariSyanti te'vidhan yantu tamprati|"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>arimathIyanagarasya yUSaphnAmA ziSya eka AsIt kintu yihUdIyebhyo bhayAt prakAzito na bhavati; sa yIzo rdehaM netuM pIlAtasyAnumatiM prArthayata, tataH pIlAtenAnumate sati sa gatvA yIzo rdeham anayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>aparaM yo nikadImo rAtrau yIzoH samIpam agacchat sopi gandharasena mizritaM prAyeNa paJcAzatseTakamaguruM gRhItvAgacchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tataste yihUdIyAnAM zmazAne sthApanarItyanusAreNa tatsugandhidravyeNa sahitaM tasya dehaM vastreNAveSTayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>aparaJca yatra sthAne taM kruze'vidhan tasya nikaTasthodyAne yatra kimapi mRtadehaM kadApi nAsthApyata tAdRzam ekaM nUtanaM zmazAnam AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAm AsAdanadinAgamanAt te tasmin samIpasthazmazAne yIzum azAyayan|</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM saptAhasya prathamadine 'tipratyUSe 'ndhakAre tiSThati magdalInI mariyam tasya zmazAnasya nikaTaM gatvA zmazAnasya mukhAt prastaramapasAritam apazyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pazcAd dhAvitvA zimonpitarAya yIzoH priyatamaziSyAya cedam akathayat, lokAH zmazAnAt prabhuM nItvA kutrAsthApayan tad vaktuM na zaknomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>ataH pitaraH sonyaziSyazca barhi rbhutvA zmazAnasthAnaM gantum ArabhetAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ubhayordhAvatoH sonyaziSyaH pitaraM pazcAt tyaktvA pUrvvaM zmazAnasthAna upasthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA prahvIbhUya sthApitavastrANi dRSTavAn kintu na prAvizat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>aparaM zimonpitara Agatya zmazAnasthAnaM pravizya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>sthApitavastrANi mastakasya vastraJca pRthak sthAnAntare sthApitaM dRSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH zmazAnasthAnaM pUrvvam Agato yonyaziSyaH sopi pravizya tAdRzaM dRSTA vyazvasIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yataH zmazAnAt sa utthApayitavya etasya dharmmapustakavacanasya bhAvaM te tadA voddhuM nAzankuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>anantaraM tau dvau ziSyau svaM svaM gRhaM parAvRtyAgacchatAm|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH paraM mariyam zmazAnadvArasya bahiH sthitvA roditum Arabhata tato rudatI prahvIbhUya zmazAnaM vilokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yIzoH zayanasthAnasya ziraHsthAne padatale ca dvayo rdizo dvau svargIyadUtAvupaviSTau samapazyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tau pRSTavantau he nAri kuto rodiSi? sAvadat lokA mama prabhuM nItvA kutrAsthApayan iti na jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ityuktvA mukhaM parAvRtya yIzuM daNDAyamAnam apazyat kintu sa yIzuriti sA jJAtuM nAzaknot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAm apRcchat he nAri kuto rodiSi? kaM vA mRgayase? tataH sA tam udyAnasevakaM jJAtvA vyAharat, he maheccha tvaM yadItaH sthAnAt taM nItavAn tarhi kutrAsthApayastad vada tatsthAnAt tam AnayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAm avadat he mariyam| tataH sA parAvRtya pratyavadat he rabbUnI arthAt he guro|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadat mAM mA dhara, idAnIM pituH samIpe UrddhvagamanaM na karomi kintu yo mama yuSmAkaJca pitA mama yuSmAkaJcezvarastasya nikaTa UrddhvagamanaM karttum udyatosmi, imAM kathAM tvaM gatvA mama bhrAtRgaNaM jJApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tato magdalInImariyam tatkSaNAd gatvA prabhustasyai darzanaM dattvA kathA etA akathayad iti vArttAM ziSyebhyo'kathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataH paraM saptAhasya prathamadinasya sandhyAsamaye ziSyA ekatra militvA yihUdIyebhyo bhiyA dvAraruddham akurvvan, etasmin kAle yIzusteSAM madhyasthAne tiSThan akathayad yuSmAkaM kalyANaM bhUyAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ityuktvA nijahastaM kukSiJca darzitavAn, tataH ziSyAH prabhuM dRSTvA hRSTA abhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yIzuH punaravadad yuSmAkaM kalyANaM bhUyAt pitA yathA mAM praiSayat tathAhamapi yuSmAn preSayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>ityuktvA sa teSAmupari dIrghaprazvAsaM dattvA kathitavAn pavitram AtmAnaM gRhlIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yUyaM yeSAM pApAni mocayiSyatha te mocayiSyante yeSAJca pApAti na mocayiSyatha te na mocayiSyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>dvAdazamadhye gaNito yamajo thomAnAmA ziSyo yIzorAgamanakAlai taiH sArddhaM nAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>ato vayaM prabhUm apazyAmeti vAkye'nyaziSyairukte sovadat, tasya hastayo rlauhakIlakAnAM cihnaM na vilokya taccihnam aGgulyA na spRSTvA tasya kukSau hastaM nAropya cAhaM na vizvasiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>aparam aSTame'hni gate sati thomAsahitaH ziSyagaNa ekatra militvA dvAraM ruddhvAbhyantara AsIt, etarhi yIzusteSAM madhyasthAne tiSThan akathayat, yuSmAkaM kuzalaM bhUyAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>pazcAt thAmai kathitavAn tvam aGgulIm atrArpayitvA mama karau pazya karaM prasAryya mama kukSAvarpaya nAvizvasya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA thomA avadat, he mama prabho he madIzvara|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yIzurakathayat, he thomA mAM nirIkSya vizvasiSi ye na dRSTvA vizvasanti taeva dhanyAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>etadanyAni pustake'smin alikhitAni bahUnyAzcaryyakarmmANi yIzuH ziSyANAM purastAd akarot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintu yIzurIzvarasyAbhiSiktaH suta eveti yathA yUyaM vizvasitha vizvasya ca tasya nAmnA paramAyuH prApnutha tadartham etAni sarvvANyalikhyanta|</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM tibiriyAjaladhestaTe yIzuH punarapi ziSyebhyo darzanaM dattavAn darzanasyAkhyAnamidam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>zimonpitaraH yamajathomA gAlIlIyakAnnAnagaranivAsI nithanel sivadeH putrAvanyau dvau ziSyau caiteSvekatra militeSu zimonpitaro'kathayat matsyAn dhartuM yAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataste vyAharan tarhi vayamapi tvayA sArddhaM yAmaH tadA te bahirgatAH santaH kSipraM nAvam Arohan kintu tasyAM rajanyAm ekamapi na prApnuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>prabhAte sati yIzustaTe sthitavAn kintu sa yIzuriti ziSyA jJAtuM nAzaknuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA yIzurapRcchat, he vatsA sannidhau kiJcit khAdyadravyam Aste? te'vadan kimapi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA so'vadat naukAyA dakSiNapArzve jAlaM nikSipata tato lapsyadhve, tasmAt tai rnikSipte jAle matsyA etAvanto'patan yena te jAlamAkRSya nottolayituM zaktAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tasmAd yIzoH priyatamaziSyaH pitarAyAkathayat eSa prabhu rbhavet, eSa prabhuriti vAcaM zrutvaiva zimon nagnatAheto rmatsyadhAriNa uttarIyavastraM paridhAya hradaM pratyudalamphayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>apare ziSyA matsyaiH sArddhaM jAlam AkarSantaH kSudranaukAM vAhayitvA kUlamAnayan te kUlAd atidUre nAsan dvizatahastebhyo dUra Asan ityanumIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tIraM prAptaistaistatra prajvalitAgnistadupari matsyAH pUpAzca dRSTAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIzurakathayad yAn matsyAn adharata teSAM katipayAn Anayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ataH zimonpitaraH parAvRtya gatvA bRhadbhistripaJcAzadadhikazatamatsyaiH paripUrNaM tajjAlam AkRSyodatolayat kintvetAvadbhi rmatsyairapi jAlaM nAchidyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzustAn avAdIt yUyamAgatya bhuMgdhvaM; tadA saeva prabhuriti jJAtatvAt tvaM kaH? iti praSTuM ziSyANAM kasyApi pragalbhatA nAbhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tato yIzurAgatya pUpAn matsyAMzca gRhItvA tebhyaH paryyaveSayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>itthaM zmazAnAdutthAnAt paraM yIzuH ziSyebhyastRtIyavAraM darzanaM dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>bhojane samApte sati yIzuH zimonpitaraM pRSTavAn, he yUnasaH putra zimon tvaM kim etebhyodhikaM mayi prIyase? tataH sa uditavAn satyaM prabho tvayi prIye'haM tad bhavAn jAnAti; tadA yIzurakathayat tarhi mama meSazAvakagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataH sa dvitIyavAraM pRSTavAn he yUnasaH putra zimon tvaM kiM mayi prIyase? tataH sa uktavAn satyaM prabho tvayi prIye'haM tad bhavAn jAnAti; tadA yIzurakathayata tarhi mama meSagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>pazcAt sa tRtIyavAraM pRSTavAn, he yUnasaH putra zimon tvaM kiM mayi prIyase? etadvAkyaM tRtIyavAraM pRSTavAn tasmAt pitaro duHkhito bhUtvA'kathayat he prabho bhavataH kimapyagocaraM nAsti tvayyahaM prIye tad bhavAn jAnAti; tato yIzuravadat tarhi mama meSagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM tubhyaM yathArthaM kathayAmi yauvanakAle svayaM baddhakaTi ryatrecchA tatra yAtavAn kintvitaH paraM vRddhe vayasi hastaM vistArayiSyasi, anyajanastvAM baddhvA yatra gantuM tavecchA na bhavati tvAM dhRtvA tatra neSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>phalataH kIdRzena maraNena sa Izvarasya mahimAnaM prakAzayiSyati tad bodhayituM sa iti vAkyaM proktavAn| ityukte sati sa tamavocat mama pazcAd Agaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yo jano rAtrikAle yIzo rvakSo'valambya, he prabho ko bhavantaM parakareSu samarpayiSyatIti vAkyaM pRSTavAn, taM yIzoH priyatamaziSyaM pazcAd AgacchantaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>pitaro mukhaM parAvarttya vilokya yIzuM pRSTavAn, he prabho etasya mAnavasya kIdRzI gati rbhaviSyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sa pratyavadat, mama punarAgamanaparyyantaM yadi taM sthApayitum icchAmi tatra tava kiM? tvaM mama pazcAd Agaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmAt sa ziSyo na mariSyatIti bhrAtRgaNamadhye kiMvadantI jAtA kintu sa na mariSyatIti vAkyaM yIzu rnAvadat kevalaM mama punarAgamanaparyyantaM yadi taM sthApayitum icchAmi tatra tava kiM? iti vAkyam uktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yo jana etAni sarvvANi likhitavAn atra sAkSyaJca dattavAn saeva sa ziSyaH, tasya sAkSyaM pramANamiti vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yIzuretebhyo'parANyapi bahUni karmmANi kRtavAn tAni sarvvANi yadyekaikaM kRtvA likhyante tarhi granthA etAvanto bhavanti teSAM dhAraNe pRthivyAM sthAnaM na bhavati| iti||</para>
</usx>
